WEBVTT

1
00:00:20.521 --> 00:00:23.023
<i>I was five when I first confessed my love.</i>

2
00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:26.276
<i>It was a success,
but it happened on a grave.</i>

3
00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.695
<i>And the boy was my cousin.</i>

4
00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:30.405
KANG-JIN, I LIKE YOU

5
00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:32.699
<i>The second time was in third grade.</i>

6
00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:37.204
<i>I wrote "I like you" on a note,</i>

7
00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:40.374
<i>and he wrote back, "I like you too."</i>

8
00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:43.377
<i>Then he moved schools the very next day.</i>

9
00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:47.089
<i>Seriously, why say yes in the first place?</i>

10
00:00:49.508 --> 00:00:50.342
<i>Then it happened.</i>

11
00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:51.593
Three, two, one.

12
00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:54.680
<i>My curly hair genes started kicking in.</i>

13
00:00:57.099 --> 00:00:58.642
Three, two, one.

14
00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:02.729
<i>Unlike my fraternal twin Hye-ri,</i>

15
00:01:02.813 --> 00:01:04.648
<i>my hair turned into a tangled mess,</i>

16
00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:07.734
<i>and so did my life.</i>

17
00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:20.330
<i>The day I was gonna ask out
the boy next door,</i>

18
00:01:20.831 --> 00:01:26.169
<i>he left with Hye-ri instead,
her hair all sleek and perfect.</i>

19
00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:30.632
<i>That's when I decided.</i>

20
00:01:32.676 --> 00:01:34.970
<i>I'll never confess my love ever again.</i>

21
00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.352
<i>Never.</i>

22
00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.108
<i>I said never.</i>

23
00:01:50.068 --> 00:01:52.613
LOVE UNTANGLED

24
00:01:52.696 --> 00:01:55.032
SIMPLE DIY HAIRSTYLES

25
00:02:08.545 --> 00:02:09.546
Hey.

26
00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:11.465
What are you doing?

27
00:02:12.341 --> 00:02:15.218
Hey! It's my turn this week.

28
00:02:15.302 --> 00:02:17.304
I gotta listen to <i>Good Morning Pops</i>.

29
00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:23.560
Mom, she's breaking our deal.

30
00:02:23.644 --> 00:02:26.313
Why all the fuss
this early in the morning?

31
00:02:26.396 --> 00:02:29.191
She always does whatever she wants.

32
00:02:29.691 --> 00:02:32.486
But she says she needs it to study.

33
00:02:32.569 --> 00:02:35.739
And, Se-ri,
you only ever listen to Korean pop.

34
00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:38.617
Then I want a CD player.

35
00:02:39.284 --> 00:02:41.620
Sure, just trade your mom for one.

36
00:02:41.703 --> 00:02:42.703
Here.

37
00:02:43.038 --> 00:02:44.289
Honey.

38
00:02:44.373 --> 00:02:45.707
What are you watching?

39
00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:47.125
PAK SE-RI, GOLF QUEEN

40
00:02:47.209 --> 00:02:49.753
- Come eat.
- Look, Se-ri. Check that out.

41
00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.171
Nothing is impossible.

42
00:02:52.339 --> 00:02:53.674
She's the best in the world.

43
00:02:53.757 --> 00:02:56.385
- Some things are impossible.
- That's not true.

44
00:02:56.468 --> 00:02:57.886
I said come eat.

45
00:02:57.969 --> 00:02:58.970
Your name's Se-ri too.

46
00:02:59.054 --> 00:03:02.099
Here, this hair right here.

47
00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:06.436
This curly hair you gave me
is impossible to straighten.

48
00:03:07.229 --> 00:03:08.313
Oh, come on.

49
00:03:08.897 --> 00:03:10.732
That's money saved on perms.

50
00:03:10.816 --> 00:03:13.193
Dad! It actually costs way more.

51
00:03:13.276 --> 00:03:15.320
Do you know
how expensive straightening is?

52
00:03:15.404 --> 00:03:16.697
Will you pay for it?

53
00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:19.074
No breakfast if you don't come now!
Come eat!

54
00:03:19.658 --> 00:03:20.659
All right.

55
00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:23.120
- Hey, Oh-my-Seri!
- Hurry up!

56
00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:25.080
Come on out!

57
00:03:29.626 --> 00:03:32.295
Hye-ri was being a pain again
this morning.

58
00:03:32.379 --> 00:03:33.755
Yeah?

59
00:03:33.839 --> 00:03:35.132
What now?

60
00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.179
- I won.
- Give it.

61
00:03:41.263 --> 00:03:42.097
Here.

62
00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:45.142
Hey, is it true
she came top in her school again?

63
00:03:45.225 --> 00:03:47.018
Whatever, I don't care.

64
00:03:47.102 --> 00:03:48.186
What's this?

65
00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:51.481
Hey, you two are nothing alike.
Are you really sisters?

66
00:03:51.565 --> 00:03:54.234
Da-ul, don't push it.

67
00:03:54.317 --> 00:03:58.321
Yeah, and Oh-my-Seri here
is far cuter than Hye-ri.

68
00:03:59.448 --> 00:04:00.991
- Sol-ji.
- Hmm?

69
00:04:01.491 --> 00:04:03.535
Do you owe Se-ri or something?

70
00:04:03.618 --> 00:04:06.413
Se-ri, just this once,
can we switch desk mates?

71
00:04:06.496 --> 00:04:08.165
Why? You have Sung-rae again?

72
00:04:08.248 --> 00:04:10.500
I can tolerate him,
but not as my desk mate.

73
00:04:10.584 --> 00:04:11.918
My ears can't take it.

74
00:04:12.419 --> 00:04:13.419
Hey!

75
00:04:13.754 --> 00:04:15.422
Oh-my-Seri and Solbangul!

76
00:04:15.505 --> 00:04:16.882
What a lovely day!

77
00:04:16.965 --> 00:04:18.258
It's him.

78
00:04:18.341 --> 00:04:19.885
Hurry, let's go.

79
00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.601
Hey!

80
00:04:28.643 --> 00:04:31.271
GARAM HIGH SCHOOL

81
00:04:41.740 --> 00:04:42.616
Here.

82
00:04:42.699 --> 00:04:44.451
- It looks so heavy.
- Just take it.

83
00:04:49.956 --> 00:04:51.166
It's Kim Hyun.

84
00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:53.043
Isn't that Hyun?

85
00:04:53.126 --> 00:04:54.126
Look at him!

86
00:04:56.671 --> 00:04:57.923
It's Kim Hyun!

87
00:05:04.304 --> 00:05:05.304
<i>Kim Hyun.</i>

88
00:05:06.348 --> 00:05:09.184
<i>The boy that half of my school
has a crush on.</i>

89
00:05:11.394 --> 00:05:14.815
<i>Did he just wave at me?</i>

90
00:05:14.898 --> 00:05:15.898
Do you know her?

91
00:05:22.906 --> 00:05:23.990
What was that?

92
00:05:24.074 --> 00:05:25.367
Why did he wave at you?

93
00:05:26.618 --> 00:05:27.661
Well,

94
00:05:28.328 --> 00:05:29.454
at the beach yesterday...

95
00:05:29.538 --> 00:05:31.248
- Yes, what?
- Go on.

96
00:05:36.044 --> 00:05:40.298
<i>It was nice out, so I went for a swim.</i>

97
00:05:54.855 --> 00:05:56.273
KIM HYUN

98
00:06:13.373 --> 00:06:15.333
<i>What are you doing here?</i>

99
00:06:17.836 --> 00:06:18.920
Same school, huh?

100
00:06:21.798 --> 00:06:23.383
I thought only I knew this spot.

101
00:06:25.594 --> 00:06:28.346
<i>That's what I thought too.</i>

102
00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:31.391
Wait, he left his clothes
right next to yours?

103
00:06:31.892 --> 00:06:32.892
Yeah.

104
00:06:33.226 --> 00:06:36.313
Why? Why did he do that?
Maybe it means something.

105
00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:37.939
Seems flirty.

106
00:06:39.941 --> 00:06:42.861
Guys, excuse us.
Not interested in any of that.

107
00:06:42.944 --> 00:06:45.155
Make way. Let us through.

108
00:06:45.238 --> 00:06:46.072
Move it.

109
00:06:46.156 --> 00:06:48.036
1ST SEMESTER 2ND MOCK EXAM
SENIOR CLASS RANKINGS

110
00:06:48.825 --> 00:06:51.494
Why are you even looking?
You're not on it.

111
00:06:53.204 --> 00:06:55.332
- Hyun.
- It's really him.

112
00:06:55.415 --> 00:06:56.249
100TH, KIM HYUN

113
00:06:56.333 --> 00:06:58.919
Se-ri, he's moving
to the self-study room, then.

114
00:06:59.419 --> 00:07:02.964
<i>The self-study room is
only for the top 100 students.</i>

115
00:07:03.048 --> 00:07:04.090
<i>Legend has it,</i>

116
00:07:04.174 --> 00:07:07.052
<i>if you ask someone out there,
it always works.</i>

117
00:07:07.135 --> 00:07:10.805
No more ocean swims for me.
I always get hungry in there.

118
00:07:10.889 --> 00:07:14.142
I'm too sticky to go for <i>tteokbokki,</i>
but too lazy to go home and shower.

119
00:07:14.225 --> 00:07:16.227
But I always end up craving <i>tteokbokki.</i>

120
00:07:16.728 --> 00:07:18.855
And it tastes better when you eat out.

121
00:07:19.356 --> 00:07:21.524
Hey, have you been to Cheongsu Snacks?

122
00:07:21.608 --> 00:07:22.609
Sung-rae.

123
00:07:23.902 --> 00:07:25.070
You have?

124
00:07:25.153 --> 00:07:28.573
Now I get why they say
their ears hurt around you.

125
00:07:28.657 --> 00:07:29.657
Who said that?

126
00:07:30.033 --> 00:07:31.159
Was it Sol-ji?

127
00:07:31.826 --> 00:07:33.286
Hey, Ma Sol-ji!

128
00:07:34.412 --> 00:07:35.914
Ever been to Cheongsu Snacks?

129
00:07:36.414 --> 00:07:38.959
Stop talking, will you? You talk too much.

130
00:07:39.042 --> 00:07:41.336
Don't you have stuff to do?
Finished writing lines?

131
00:07:43.088 --> 00:07:44.422
Lines? Of course…

132
00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:46.424
I haven't.

133
00:07:53.723 --> 00:07:54.723
Attention.

134
00:07:55.183 --> 00:07:56.101
Bow.

135
00:07:56.184 --> 00:07:58.228
Good morning.

136
00:07:59.104 --> 00:08:01.272
Today, I need to tell you

137
00:08:02.399 --> 00:08:03.817
some bad news.

138
00:08:04.359 --> 00:08:08.655
The school trip you missed last year
because of the typhoon,

139
00:08:10.031 --> 00:08:11.783
you're going this year.

140
00:08:15.495 --> 00:08:16.579
Quiet!

141
00:08:17.956 --> 00:08:21.501
What kind of school sends seniors
on a school trip?

142
00:08:22.377 --> 00:08:24.004
The school board has lost it.

143
00:08:24.754 --> 00:08:27.841
So, for your lines assignment,

144
00:08:27.924 --> 00:08:30.427
I want two notebooks a week.

145
00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.345
- What?
- Oh no!

146
00:08:32.429 --> 00:08:33.429
Please!

147
00:08:34.514 --> 00:08:35.724
Over here.

148
00:08:36.850 --> 00:08:37.850
I'm open!

149
00:08:40.353 --> 00:08:42.063
- Wow.
- Nice one!

150
00:08:42.147 --> 00:08:43.147
Good shot.

151
00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:46.985
- Hey.
- Huh?

152
00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.572
To Won-yeong!

153
00:08:50.655 --> 00:08:52.365
- Right here.
- Pass it!

154
00:08:52.449 --> 00:08:53.450
One more pass.

155
00:08:55.660 --> 00:08:56.828
- Nice!
- All right.

156
00:08:58.204 --> 00:08:59.205
I'm doing it.

157
00:08:59.831 --> 00:09:00.831
Here you go.

158
00:09:01.541 --> 00:09:02.541
Ma'am.

159
00:09:03.126 --> 00:09:04.294
I'll take a Neverstop.

160
00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:20.477
Could you keep this
for the tall boy playing...

161
00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:21.603
Kim Hyun?

162
00:09:22.187 --> 00:09:23.354
Yes! How did you know?

163
00:09:24.272 --> 00:09:27.275
There are just too many SRs today.

164
00:09:27.358 --> 00:09:30.320
Su-rin, Seong-ryeon, and now Se-ri.

165
00:09:31.946 --> 00:09:34.449
Think of something unique
to catch his eye.

166
00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:37.535
With all those, his bladder's gonna burst.

167
00:09:37.619 --> 00:09:38.703
FOR HYUN
FROM JI-HYE

168
00:09:40.455 --> 00:09:41.498
Can I have one?

169
00:09:42.165 --> 00:09:43.291
It's hot.

170
00:09:47.378 --> 00:09:48.379
Rock, paper, scissors.

171
00:09:48.463 --> 00:09:49.798
- Loser eats this?
- Yeah.

172
00:09:50.924 --> 00:09:52.258
Park Se-ri.

173
00:09:52.342 --> 00:09:53.676
Flintstone.

174
00:09:54.177 --> 00:09:57.722
<i>Flintstone's real name is Ko In-jung.</i>

175
00:09:57.806 --> 00:09:59.390
Done some brushing today, have you?

176
00:09:59.474 --> 00:10:02.644
<i>The nickname
comes from her Bronze Age hairstyle.</i>

177
00:10:02.727 --> 00:10:04.771
Just calmed it down a bit.

178
00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:10.443
<i>Together, we used to straighten our hair
with pencil boards.</i>

179
00:10:13.196 --> 00:10:14.989
<i>You're into Hyun too?</i>

180
00:10:24.457 --> 00:10:27.710
PARK SE-RI

181
00:10:49.357 --> 00:10:50.567
"Park Se-ri."

182
00:10:53.361 --> 00:10:54.529
It's a pretty name.

183
00:10:56.906 --> 00:10:58.032
It suits you.

184
00:11:35.403 --> 00:11:37.322
PARK SE-RI

185
00:12:16.819 --> 00:12:17.862
Hey!

186
00:12:20.698 --> 00:12:21.866
Help!

187
00:12:24.661 --> 00:12:26.162
Hey, wake up!

188
00:12:26.246 --> 00:12:28.081
You gotta be kidding me!

189
00:12:46.182 --> 00:12:47.308
You okay?

190
00:12:47.392 --> 00:12:49.686
Are you all right now?

191
00:12:54.315 --> 00:12:55.650
You really scared me.

192
00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:59.112
Why did you go in if you can't even swim?

193
00:13:01.698 --> 00:13:03.199
What the hell?

194
00:13:07.245 --> 00:13:11.958
Damn it! Stay out of the water, mister.
It's dangerous.

195
00:13:24.095 --> 00:13:26.639
GARAM HIGH SCHOOL

196
00:13:26.723 --> 00:13:28.641
FACULTY ROOM

197
00:13:28.725 --> 00:13:30.101
I see, so that's what happened.

198
00:13:30.893 --> 00:13:34.897
Don't distract others, though,
even if you're not taking the CSAT.

199
00:13:34.981 --> 00:13:36.816
I know you're a year older,

200
00:13:37.317 --> 00:13:38.901
but try to get along with everyone.

201
00:13:39.402 --> 00:13:42.280
Breaking news! Someone's here!

202
00:13:43.448 --> 00:13:44.532
This is huge!

203
00:13:44.615 --> 00:13:46.617
You always say that.

204
00:13:47.118 --> 00:13:50.371
- Guess what I saw in the faculty room.
- What? What is it?

205
00:13:58.296 --> 00:14:02.133
Today, we have a new student
joining us all the way from Seoul.

206
00:14:02.216 --> 00:14:04.052
- Seoul?
- Introduce yourself.

207
00:14:06.846 --> 00:14:08.306
I'm Han Yun-seok.

208
00:14:10.224 --> 00:14:11.225
That's it?

209
00:14:13.478 --> 00:14:14.479
That's it.

210
00:14:15.438 --> 00:14:18.316
Look at his leg.
Bet he caused trouble before coming here.

211
00:14:18.399 --> 00:14:21.277
- Take the seat at the back.
- I heard he got held back a year.

212
00:14:21.361 --> 00:14:23.488
What? He got held back?

213
00:14:23.571 --> 00:14:25.323
Se-ri, what's all that jabber?

214
00:14:29.035 --> 00:14:30.286
Yun-seok.

215
00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:31.954
Don't cause trouble.

216
00:14:33.456 --> 00:14:35.875
- And, all of you, be nice to him.
- Yes, sir.

217
00:14:35.958 --> 00:14:37.835
How many days till the CSAT?

218
00:14:37.919 --> 00:14:40.254
184 days.

219
00:14:40.338 --> 00:14:41.798
What's our job as seniors?

220
00:14:41.881 --> 00:14:43.716
Studying.

221
00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:44.801
That's all.

222
00:14:57.772 --> 00:14:59.315
We meet again.

223
00:14:59.941 --> 00:15:00.941
Mister.

224
00:15:03.319 --> 00:15:04.320
Yeah.

225
00:15:06.739 --> 00:15:09.409
So this must be from yesterday.

226
00:15:14.747 --> 00:15:18.292
Still, you're lucky I was there.
That was a close one.

227
00:15:18.876 --> 00:15:19.710
Mister.

228
00:15:19.794 --> 00:15:20.794
Right.

229
00:15:29.262 --> 00:15:32.140
Hey, what was that? You know each other?

230
00:15:32.223 --> 00:15:34.642
No. We met at the beach yesterday.

231
00:15:34.725 --> 00:15:36.227
Huh? At the beach?

232
00:15:36.727 --> 00:15:37.770
Doing what?

233
00:15:37.854 --> 00:15:39.355
It's a long story.

234
00:15:40.231 --> 00:15:41.441
You went there for Hyun?

235
00:15:44.235 --> 00:15:46.154
- Right?
- No, I didn't.

236
00:15:46.237 --> 00:15:47.447
- Come on.
- You did.

237
00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:49.031
You definitely did!

238
00:15:49.115 --> 00:15:51.492
- You didn't?
- I said no!

239
00:15:51.576 --> 00:15:52.410
You did!

240
00:15:52.493 --> 00:15:54.412
- Yes, you did.
- Just tell us.

241
00:16:16.392 --> 00:16:18.895
Hey. Isn't that Sung-rae?

242
00:16:20.062 --> 00:16:21.063
What is he doing?

243
00:16:25.776 --> 00:16:29.363
Hey, what are you doing?
Why are you creeping like that?

244
00:16:29.447 --> 00:16:30.573
Look at Yun-seok.

245
00:16:30.656 --> 00:16:34.410
Umbrella, bags, crutch.
He's got his hands full.

246
00:16:34.494 --> 00:16:36.579
Then why don't you go help him?

247
00:16:36.662 --> 00:16:39.373
Well, I don't really want to make a fuss.

248
00:16:39.957 --> 00:16:43.544
Sung-rae, you <i>are</i>
the walking, talking fuss.

249
00:16:47.006 --> 00:16:48.508
What? Come on!

250
00:16:49.884 --> 00:16:51.802
You're getting all wet.

251
00:16:52.803 --> 00:16:53.846
Mister.

252
00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:57.975
- I'm fine.
- No, you're not.

253
00:16:58.059 --> 00:16:59.727
We're gonna be late. Walk faster.

254
00:17:00.228 --> 00:17:01.228
Please.

255
00:17:03.022 --> 00:17:04.022
Look.

256
00:17:04.065 --> 00:17:05.691
Now Se-ri is helping him.

257
00:17:09.862 --> 00:17:10.862
Stop, you three.

258
00:17:11.489 --> 00:17:12.865
Sung-rae, get over here.

259
00:17:14.242 --> 00:17:18.120
Your buddy's struggling with a bad leg
in the rain,

260
00:17:18.204 --> 00:17:20.831
and you look perfectly dry and cozy.

261
00:17:20.915 --> 00:17:22.124
It's not like that...

262
00:17:22.208 --> 00:17:24.001
Don't just stand there. Take his bag.

263
00:17:31.968 --> 00:17:34.679
Se-ri, do you have anything to say?

264
00:17:36.556 --> 00:17:37.557
Me?

265
00:17:39.559 --> 00:17:42.853
It's just the rain.
You know me. I didn't get a perm.

266
00:17:42.937 --> 00:17:43.937
Not that.

267
00:17:44.605 --> 00:17:45.773
Your name tag.

268
00:17:46.816 --> 00:17:48.818
What? Where did it go?

269
00:17:48.901 --> 00:17:51.487
I put it on this morning, but it's gone.

270
00:17:51.571 --> 00:17:53.447
You'd better have it on tomorrow

271
00:17:53.531 --> 00:17:55.741
or I'm making you an appointment
for some extra curls.

272
00:17:55.825 --> 00:17:56.826
Actually, I…

273
00:18:01.706 --> 00:18:08.713
PILOT SITE FOR SCHOOL MEAL PROGRAM
GARAM HIGH SCHOOL

274
00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:17.263
Run!

275
00:18:17.847 --> 00:18:19.223
Stop pushing!

276
00:18:22.184 --> 00:18:23.394
Hey.

277
00:18:23.894 --> 00:18:25.021
Over there.

278
00:18:25.104 --> 00:18:26.188
Oh my.

279
00:18:26.814 --> 00:18:28.232
He looks so helpless.

280
00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:31.569
Why does he keep getting on my nerves?

281
00:18:40.369 --> 00:18:41.203
<i>Oppa</i>.

282
00:18:41.287 --> 00:18:42.455
Enjoy your meal.

283
00:18:42.538 --> 00:18:45.333
He's our classmate.
What's with the formality?

284
00:18:45.416 --> 00:18:47.209
But he's older, so he's an <i>oppa</i>.

285
00:18:48.878 --> 00:18:49.754
There's no need.

286
00:18:49.837 --> 00:18:52.089
See? Mister wants it that way.

287
00:18:52.173 --> 00:18:55.468
Se-ri, you're one to talk.
Why do you call him "Mister"?

288
00:18:55.551 --> 00:18:58.137
Yeah, you can just call him <i>oppa</i>.

289
00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:01.057
Nah, I just can't say that, ever.

290
00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:05.978
I've never said that my whole life.
I'm almost allergic to it.

291
00:19:08.439 --> 00:19:09.439
Whatever's fine.

292
00:19:09.982 --> 00:19:12.443
All right, Yun-seok.
Let's keep it casual around here.

293
00:19:12.943 --> 00:19:13.944
Eat up.

294
00:19:14.945 --> 00:19:16.197
Shall we do that, then?

295
00:19:17.114 --> 00:19:18.574
I mean, can I?

296
00:19:19.533 --> 00:19:23.037
By the way, <i>oppa,</i>
I heard Se-ri rescued you at the beach.

297
00:19:23.537 --> 00:19:24.455
Huh?

298
00:19:24.538 --> 00:19:26.040
That means she's your savior.

299
00:19:26.123 --> 00:19:27.123
Right?

300
00:19:27.875 --> 00:19:30.586
Yun-seok, I'm your lifesaver, aren't I?

301
00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:33.464
I carried your umbrella earlier
and even grabbed your lunch.

302
00:19:34.048 --> 00:19:36.801
Ice cream.

303
00:19:36.884 --> 00:19:41.263
Ice cream!

304
00:19:41.347 --> 00:19:43.349
- Thanks for the ice cream.
- Sure.

305
00:19:44.392 --> 00:19:47.353
I'm not saying it because of this,
but you're kinda cool.

306
00:19:47.436 --> 00:19:49.980
Hey, you barely even know him.

307
00:19:51.107 --> 00:19:52.775
I heard you're ditching the CSAT.

308
00:19:53.359 --> 00:19:54.652
How did you know?

309
00:19:54.735 --> 00:19:55.820
Well, our teacher…

310
00:19:57.363 --> 00:19:58.698
Anyway, you have my respect.

311
00:19:58.781 --> 00:20:00.950
Giving up is never easy.

312
00:20:01.033 --> 00:20:03.035
- Look at me. I can't let go.
- What's this?

313
00:20:03.119 --> 00:20:04.203
Hold still.

314
00:20:04.286 --> 00:20:05.204
PARK SE-RI

315
00:20:05.287 --> 00:20:06.414
Wow, that looks real.

316
00:20:06.497 --> 00:20:08.999
But, Se-ri,
what'd you really do with your name tag?

317
00:20:09.083 --> 00:20:10.459
I wish I knew!

318
00:20:10.543 --> 00:20:11.669
Maybe someone took it?

319
00:20:14.463 --> 00:20:15.464
PARK SE-RI

320
00:20:15.548 --> 00:20:18.426
They say keeping someone's name tag
makes them like you back.

321
00:20:18.509 --> 00:20:20.344
Someone must have a crush on you.

322
00:20:20.845 --> 00:20:21.679
She's right.

323
00:20:21.762 --> 00:20:24.098
Someone must've taken it.

324
00:20:25.224 --> 00:20:27.935
Someone's clearly holding on to it!

325
00:20:28.018 --> 00:20:30.563
He's keeping it safe for you!

326
00:20:31.063 --> 00:20:33.649
You really think someone took it?

327
00:20:33.733 --> 00:20:36.944
Man, that makes it tough.
I'm already into Hyun.

328
00:20:37.027 --> 00:20:40.614
What if he shows up with my name tag
and says he likes me?

329
00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.457
I'm sorry. Are you okay?

330
00:20:53.461 --> 00:20:54.587
Yeah.

331
00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:57.006
Yes, well, I'm fine.

332
00:20:57.673 --> 00:20:58.674
I'm so sorry.

333
00:20:58.758 --> 00:21:00.259
- What are you doing?
- Hurry up!

334
00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:01.760
I'm coming!

335
00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:05.181
You're really okay, right? See you around.

336
00:21:06.265 --> 00:21:08.225
Hey! Get it together, man!

337
00:21:09.727 --> 00:21:10.853
Move up!

338
00:21:13.105 --> 00:21:15.107
I think he knows what he's doing.

339
00:21:15.191 --> 00:21:17.067
You saw him smile? That gaze was intense.

340
00:21:17.151 --> 00:21:19.779
Are you serious? He was looking at me?

341
00:21:19.862 --> 00:21:22.531
I'm telling you,
he was totally flirting with you.

342
00:21:23.032 --> 00:21:25.576
Maybe he hit you on purpose
just to come over.

343
00:21:25.659 --> 00:21:27.912
Right?

344
00:21:29.371 --> 00:21:30.664
I don't think so.

345
00:21:36.504 --> 00:21:37.880
What do you mean?

346
00:21:38.464 --> 00:21:40.591
I just don't think he did it on purpose.

347
00:21:41.383 --> 00:21:44.678
Oh yeah? Are your eyes that fast?

348
00:21:46.013 --> 00:21:47.348
It was clearly an accident...

349
00:21:47.431 --> 00:21:48.431
Hey!

350
00:21:49.141 --> 00:21:51.435
Whatever. Se-ri, don't listen to him.

351
00:21:51.936 --> 00:21:53.604
Forget it. What's his problem?

352
00:21:53.687 --> 00:21:54.688
Let's go.

353
00:22:02.279 --> 00:22:04.448
Can't you read the room, bro?

354
00:22:10.079 --> 00:22:12.248
I heard Hyun's into Lee Hyo-ri.

355
00:22:12.331 --> 00:22:13.415
Really?

356
00:22:13.499 --> 00:22:16.001
Yeah, he prefers her to Sung Yu-ri.

357
00:22:16.085 --> 00:22:17.419
It's the long, straight hair.

358
00:22:17.503 --> 00:22:20.256
Hey! Se-ri!

359
00:22:21.465 --> 00:22:22.925
Breaking news!

360
00:22:23.008 --> 00:22:23.926
What is it?

361
00:22:24.009 --> 00:22:26.011
I'm not in the mood right now.

362
00:22:26.095 --> 00:22:27.513
She's got straight hair!

363
00:22:27.596 --> 00:22:30.266
Oh, come on. You guys are on that too?

364
00:22:30.349 --> 00:22:32.518
No, Flintstone came with straight hair!

365
00:22:32.601 --> 00:22:34.687
What? Who? Flintstone?

366
00:22:34.770 --> 00:22:36.063
You mean <i>our </i>Flintstone?

367
00:22:42.486 --> 00:22:43.571
Flintstone?

368
00:23:01.338 --> 00:23:02.631
Flintstone.

369
00:23:03.257 --> 00:23:04.257
How…

370
00:23:04.592 --> 00:23:06.343
How did you…

371
00:23:11.015 --> 00:23:14.268
Oh, this? I got a straight perm.

372
00:23:14.351 --> 00:23:17.897
I'm not buying it.
You've had them so many times before.

373
00:23:17.980 --> 00:23:19.982
It's not just any straight perm.

374
00:23:20.482 --> 00:23:21.482
Magic.

375
00:23:21.942 --> 00:23:23.235
Magic straight perm.

376
00:23:23.944 --> 00:23:27.531
What's more,
it's a Seoul magic straight perm.

377
00:23:35.789 --> 00:23:36.789
Where?

378
00:23:38.751 --> 00:23:40.169
Rose Hair Salon.

379
00:23:41.670 --> 00:23:42.504
How much?

380
00:23:42.588 --> 00:23:43.797
200,000.

381
00:23:45.341 --> 00:23:47.134
What? 200,000 won?

382
00:23:51.305 --> 00:23:53.057
SPECIAL DEAL
ALL LENGTHS 200,000 WON!

383
00:23:53.140 --> 00:23:55.476
SEOUL MAGIC STRAIGHT
RAINPROOF AND NATURAL!

384
00:23:57.186 --> 00:24:00.272
Hi there. Do you have any questions?

385
00:24:00.356 --> 00:24:01.649
ROSE HAIR SALON

386
00:24:01.732 --> 00:24:05.486
Yes, about the Seoul magic straight perm.

387
00:24:05.569 --> 00:24:10.658
I've tried so many straight perms,
but they never lasted a day.

388
00:24:11.158 --> 00:24:12.910
What's so different about this one?

389
00:24:13.661 --> 00:24:15.162
What's different?

390
00:24:15.245 --> 00:24:17.331
It's just a whole different process.

391
00:24:17.414 --> 00:24:19.667
Different chemicals, different equipment.

392
00:24:19.750 --> 00:24:24.546
It straightens your hair
like you were born with it.

393
00:24:26.632 --> 00:24:27.632
But anyway,

394
00:24:28.092 --> 00:24:29.677
your hair…

395
00:24:31.136 --> 00:24:32.596
It's quite something.

396
00:24:33.472 --> 00:24:36.350
Well, it's still doable.
Would you like to try it?

397
00:24:37.351 --> 00:24:38.519
1000 WON

398
00:24:41.981 --> 00:24:44.733
CONGRATS ON STARTING HIGH SCHOOL!
FROM DAD

399
00:25:16.557 --> 00:25:19.309
ROSE HAIR SALON

400
00:25:23.230 --> 00:25:24.523
Mom, let me help.

401
00:25:31.613 --> 00:25:33.365
Go inside. I got this.

402
00:25:34.033 --> 00:25:35.367
Let me help.

403
00:25:36.493 --> 00:25:38.245
- "Mom"?
- It's fine, really.

404
00:25:38.328 --> 00:25:39.328
Let's go in.

405
00:25:46.378 --> 00:25:47.755
It's working!

406
00:25:49.673 --> 00:25:50.924
What is?

407
00:25:51.008 --> 00:25:52.008
Look.

408
00:25:52.051 --> 00:25:55.137
It's all about the angle and spacing.

409
00:25:55.220 --> 00:25:57.056
I should've tried this sooner.

410
00:25:57.681 --> 00:26:01.101
"Wonder… ful."

411
00:26:02.061 --> 00:26:03.729
"Ideas."

412
00:26:07.733 --> 00:26:08.817
Amazing, isn't it?

413
00:26:09.318 --> 00:26:10.235
- You want one?
- Yeah.

414
00:26:10.319 --> 00:26:11.570
Want me to make you one?

415
00:26:11.653 --> 00:26:12.654
Me too.

416
00:26:13.238 --> 00:26:15.324
Not bad at all. It'll save time.

417
00:26:40.891 --> 00:26:41.891
Yun-seok?

418
00:26:42.309 --> 00:26:43.435
What are you doing here?

419
00:26:44.019 --> 00:26:46.772
I was just passing by.

420
00:26:46.855 --> 00:26:48.190
What about you?

421
00:26:48.273 --> 00:26:50.025
Getting a haircut?

422
00:26:51.276 --> 00:26:53.779
No. This is my mom's place.

423
00:26:55.614 --> 00:26:57.324
Oh, really?

424
00:26:57.407 --> 00:26:59.952
Well then, I guess I better say hello.

425
00:27:02.037 --> 00:27:03.037
Wait!

426
00:27:03.705 --> 00:27:05.082
Yun-seok, is that you?

427
00:27:05.165 --> 00:27:07.459
Ma'am. Good afternoon.

428
00:27:08.001 --> 00:27:09.001
Yun-seok…

429
00:27:09.461 --> 00:27:13.132
I mean, <i>oppa </i>and I are in the same class.
My name is Park Se-ri.

430
00:27:14.842 --> 00:27:16.635
The one with the crazy curls?

431
00:27:17.886 --> 00:27:19.721
So you're friends with Yun-seok.

432
00:27:19.805 --> 00:27:21.557
Yes, that's right.

433
00:27:21.640 --> 00:27:24.309
You know I saved him
in the water, don't you?

434
00:27:24.393 --> 00:27:25.393
What?

435
00:27:29.189 --> 00:27:31.483
I mean, what if I hadn't been there?

436
00:27:31.567 --> 00:27:34.069
Just thinking about it
makes my hands shake.

437
00:27:34.153 --> 00:27:37.156
I wonder why he was in there
when he can't even swim.

438
00:27:37.239 --> 00:27:38.157
Mom.

439
00:27:38.240 --> 00:27:40.659
I didn't mean to go in. I just slipped.

440
00:27:41.743 --> 00:27:42.744
I see.

441
00:27:43.287 --> 00:27:44.705
You saved his life.

442
00:27:44.788 --> 00:27:45.789
That's right.

443
00:27:45.873 --> 00:27:47.166
I saved him.

444
00:27:47.666 --> 00:27:52.004
You know, I literally risked my life
for Yun-seok that day.

445
00:27:55.799 --> 00:27:57.009
Se-ri, was it?

446
00:27:57.926 --> 00:28:02.014
Are you still interested
in that magic straight perm?

447
00:28:02.097 --> 00:28:06.310
Of course I am! I'm more than interested.

448
00:28:06.393 --> 00:28:07.394
I see.

449
00:28:07.895 --> 00:28:08.729
You know,

450
00:28:08.812 --> 00:28:11.982
it's been tough for Yun-seok
with that cast on his leg.

451
00:28:12.566 --> 00:28:13.692
And he has no friends.

452
00:28:13.775 --> 00:28:14.610
Pardon?

453
00:28:14.693 --> 00:28:16.528
What do you mean?

454
00:28:17.571 --> 00:28:19.990
We are super close! Aren't we?

455
00:28:20.073 --> 00:28:22.743
<i>Oppa </i>is in good hands with me.

456
00:28:24.453 --> 00:28:25.287
All right.

457
00:28:25.370 --> 00:28:29.041
If you help him out till his cast's off,

458
00:28:29.124 --> 00:28:32.669
then I'll think about
giving you that magic straight perm.

459
00:28:32.753 --> 00:28:34.504
Really?

460
00:28:34.588 --> 00:28:36.757
Yes, of course!
You have nothing to worry about.

461
00:28:36.840 --> 00:28:38.258
- Okay.
- Leave it to me!

462
00:28:39.259 --> 00:28:40.259
Hmm?

463
00:28:52.606 --> 00:28:54.024
Wow, looks delicious.

464
00:28:54.107 --> 00:28:55.108
I'm off!

465
00:28:55.609 --> 00:28:58.403
- What about breakfast?
- It's fine. I'm busy!

466
00:28:58.487 --> 00:28:59.988
- I can do it.
- Come on out.

467
00:29:00.072 --> 00:29:01.657
- Good morning.
- Hi.

468
00:29:05.994 --> 00:29:07.829
Can't you see he's injured?

469
00:29:08.914 --> 00:29:09.914
Come on!

470
00:29:25.264 --> 00:29:27.474
ROSE HAIR SALON
SEOUL MAGIC STRAIGHT PERM

471
00:29:29.226 --> 00:29:30.644
Check out Rose Hair Salon.

472
00:29:30.727 --> 00:29:33.897
Come to Rose Hair,
the best spot for straight perms.

473
00:29:34.773 --> 00:29:35.607
Rose Hair Salon.

474
00:29:35.691 --> 00:29:37.150
Try the Seoul magic straight.

475
00:29:37.234 --> 00:29:39.069
Excuse me, Mr. Curls.

476
00:29:40.487 --> 00:29:41.488
"Mr. Curls"?

477
00:29:42.155 --> 00:29:45.575
Come here and your hair
will be straight as ever.

478
00:29:45.659 --> 00:29:48.036
Why would I want to do that, huh?

479
00:29:48.578 --> 00:29:49.413
It looks good.

480
00:29:49.496 --> 00:29:51.290
No, I don't think you get it.

481
00:29:51.373 --> 00:29:54.376
This Seoul magic straight
will actually straighten your hair.

482
00:29:54.459 --> 00:29:55.752
I got this in Seoul.

483
00:29:56.378 --> 00:29:57.713
Cost me 150,000 won.

484
00:30:04.928 --> 00:30:05.971
What the…

485
00:30:09.808 --> 00:30:11.101
You don't need to do this.

486
00:30:11.184 --> 00:30:13.478
Hey, come on. Give them back.

487
00:30:13.562 --> 00:30:14.563
Let go!

488
00:30:14.646 --> 00:30:16.315
Give me that!

489
00:30:16.398 --> 00:30:17.398
I said...

490
00:30:18.150 --> 00:30:19.150
Oh no!

491
00:30:20.694 --> 00:30:22.237
What are you doing?

492
00:30:22.321 --> 00:30:23.739
Just stand still for a second.

493
00:30:26.074 --> 00:30:27.534
- You okay?
- Maybe I broke my rib.

494
00:30:27.617 --> 00:30:28.869
Should've played smarter.

495
00:30:28.952 --> 00:30:33.081
Good thing I know how to land.
If it happened to you, you'd be dead.

496
00:30:33.165 --> 00:30:35.584
Yeah, right. I'd have made the shot.

497
00:30:35.667 --> 00:30:37.085
What are you talking about?

498
00:30:37.169 --> 00:30:40.547
You think you can ball? Are you that good?

499
00:30:42.049 --> 00:30:43.049
Hey.

500
00:30:43.383 --> 00:30:44.468
Is he gone?

501
00:30:45.135 --> 00:30:46.135
Huh?

502
00:30:53.935 --> 00:30:55.729
Man, that was really close.

503
00:30:55.812 --> 00:30:58.315
I can't let him see me looking like this.

504
00:30:59.066 --> 00:31:01.485
Like what? You look the same.

505
00:31:02.652 --> 00:31:03.987
Han Yun-seok.

506
00:31:04.613 --> 00:31:05.781
We're in trouble.

507
00:31:06.823 --> 00:31:07.824
- Darn it.
- What is it?

508
00:31:08.325 --> 00:31:09.576
Follow me.

509
00:31:09.659 --> 00:31:12.371
- Why? Where are we going?
- Hurry up!

510
00:31:18.460 --> 00:31:19.711
Be careful.

511
00:31:38.146 --> 00:31:39.356
Oh God!

512
00:31:39.856 --> 00:31:41.775
Hey, are you all right?

513
00:31:41.858 --> 00:31:44.111
Oh no. Your cast's soaked.

514
00:31:46.405 --> 00:31:47.906
What's this place anyway?

515
00:31:48.448 --> 00:31:50.325
This is my dad's storage room.

516
00:31:50.409 --> 00:31:51.410
Wait.

517
00:31:57.124 --> 00:31:58.208
Here.

518
00:32:04.673 --> 00:32:06.675
You can get changed there. I won't look.

519
00:32:08.051 --> 00:32:09.177
Is this yours?

520
00:32:09.761 --> 00:32:12.931
No, that's my dad's.
Everything here is his.

521
00:32:20.397 --> 00:32:21.481
Are you done?

522
00:32:24.192 --> 00:32:25.360
Yeah.

523
00:32:32.701 --> 00:32:34.202
All of this is your dad's too?

524
00:32:34.703 --> 00:32:35.537
Yep.

525
00:32:35.620 --> 00:32:39.040
Oh, except for this. This is my spot.

526
00:32:40.375 --> 00:32:42.085
Do you like comic books?

527
00:32:42.169 --> 00:32:43.169
No.

528
00:32:44.463 --> 00:32:45.839
I mean,

529
00:32:46.339 --> 00:32:47.716
I've just never read one.

530
00:32:47.799 --> 00:32:48.799
What?

531
00:32:48.842 --> 00:32:51.845
You've never read a comic book before?

532
00:32:52.721 --> 00:32:53.805
That's right.

533
00:32:58.268 --> 00:32:59.268
Hey.

534
00:32:59.769 --> 00:33:02.397
I don't show these to just anyone.

535
00:33:03.190 --> 00:33:04.191
Sit down.

536
00:33:04.274 --> 00:33:07.819
They're my dad's, so no lending.
But you can come read sometimes.

537
00:33:07.903 --> 00:33:08.987
I'll allow it.

538
00:33:09.070 --> 00:33:10.697
No, I'm fine.

539
00:33:11.823 --> 00:33:12.908
Hey, Yun-seok.

540
00:33:12.991 --> 00:33:17.787
Seriously, you cannot miss out on this.

541
00:33:30.509 --> 00:33:31.510
Here.

542
00:33:39.226 --> 00:33:40.435
For God's sake.

543
00:33:40.519 --> 00:33:44.231
You have a long way to go.
You should come by more to read.

544
00:33:44.314 --> 00:33:45.857
The padlock combination here is

545
00:33:46.358 --> 00:33:47.692
four, eight, six.

546
00:33:47.776 --> 00:33:48.776
What?

547
00:33:49.444 --> 00:33:51.655
- Four, eight, six?
- Hey, keep it down!

548
00:33:51.738 --> 00:33:52.989
Someone could hear you.

549
00:33:53.823 --> 00:33:55.742
Who? There's someone else here?

550
00:33:55.825 --> 00:33:59.955
No, I mean we don't want
anyone else knowing it's 486 too.

551
00:34:00.038 --> 00:34:02.082
- Two? 4862?
- No.

552
00:34:02.165 --> 00:34:04.292
No, it's not 4862!

553
00:34:04.376 --> 00:34:05.752
Come on!

554
00:34:05.835 --> 00:34:08.046
Give me your hand.
I'll write it down for you.

555
00:34:08.129 --> 00:34:10.465
No, I got it. It's 486.

556
00:34:10.549 --> 00:34:12.050
Hey! Shush!

557
00:34:12.884 --> 00:34:15.387
Make sure you keep this a secret.

558
00:34:15.470 --> 00:34:17.639
Only my dad and I come here.

559
00:34:18.139 --> 00:34:19.474
Especially Sung-rae.

560
00:34:19.975 --> 00:34:22.227
If he ever finds out, it'll all be over.

561
00:34:22.310 --> 00:34:26.398
Ugh, my ears still hurt because of him.

562
00:34:40.620 --> 00:34:41.496
GO FOR HYUN'S HEART

563
00:34:41.580 --> 00:34:43.039
First of all, thank you all so much…

564
00:34:43.123 --> 00:34:45.041
OPERATION
"LOVE CONFESSION IN SELF-STUDY ROOM"

565
00:34:45.125 --> 00:34:47.961
…for taking part
in the biggest moment of my life.

566
00:34:48.044 --> 00:34:50.505
Don't be silly, girl. No way I'd miss it.

567
00:34:50.589 --> 00:34:52.090
We're friends, aren't we?

568
00:34:54.634 --> 00:34:55.634
Here.

569
00:34:59.598 --> 00:35:01.850
- This is how you fold it, right?
- Yeah.

570
00:35:02.767 --> 00:35:03.893
What are we doing?

571
00:35:03.977 --> 00:35:05.145
What else?

572
00:35:05.812 --> 00:35:07.814
Oh-my-Seri is going to ask Hyun out.

573
00:35:08.315 --> 00:35:10.025
You can fold crane eggs, can't you?

574
00:35:10.734 --> 00:35:11.943
Crane eggs?

575
00:35:13.320 --> 00:35:14.404
Crane's eggs?

576
00:35:15.113 --> 00:35:16.323
Crane eggs.

577
00:35:18.450 --> 00:35:21.244
We'll fold each with all our hearts
and make exactly 1,000.

578
00:35:21.328 --> 00:35:22.579
You think 1,000 is enough?

579
00:35:22.662 --> 00:35:25.373
Mi-jin from the next class
folded 1,000 cranes, not eggs.

580
00:35:25.457 --> 00:35:27.208
Then we'll make 10,000.

581
00:35:27.792 --> 00:35:28.627
- What?
- 10,000?

582
00:35:28.710 --> 00:35:29.544
- Seriously?
- Yeah.

583
00:35:29.628 --> 00:35:30.962
- Not possible.
- We can do it!

584
00:35:31.046 --> 00:35:32.339
- Too many.
- Sounds great.

585
00:35:32.422 --> 00:35:34.174
- No, it doesn't.
- You fold 1,000.

586
00:35:34.257 --> 00:35:35.175
- No.
- Let's do it.

587
00:35:35.258 --> 00:35:36.676
Yun-seok.

588
00:35:37.302 --> 00:35:38.553
Where are you going?

589
00:35:39.304 --> 00:35:42.724
Don't you realize
how big your role is here?

590
00:35:43.308 --> 00:35:44.684
My role?

591
00:35:44.768 --> 00:35:45.768
Yes.

592
00:35:47.395 --> 00:35:50.857
"Seoul magic straight perm.
Han Yun-seok in charge."

593
00:35:52.776 --> 00:35:54.944
But I'm not good at paper folding...

594
00:35:55.028 --> 00:35:56.738
You're our friend, aren't you?

595
00:35:56.821 --> 00:35:57.821
That's right.

596
00:35:58.531 --> 00:36:00.575
I guess Seoul kids
are all about themselves.

597
00:36:00.659 --> 00:36:03.036
No, it's fine. Let him go.

598
00:36:03.119 --> 00:36:05.914
He's probably super busy
with something else.

599
00:36:06.539 --> 00:36:08.833
This is what I get for saving his life.

600
00:36:09.542 --> 00:36:10.585
- Uh-oh.
- Oh dear.

601
00:36:10.669 --> 00:36:11.878
It's all right.

602
00:36:12.462 --> 00:36:13.462
Now,

603
00:36:14.005 --> 00:36:15.090
from here,

604
00:36:15.173 --> 00:36:17.175
make one more triangle.

605
00:36:17.676 --> 00:36:19.177
Hey, that's a good-looking triangle.

606
00:36:23.765 --> 00:36:26.559
- Read it aloud. "Until."
- "Until."

607
00:36:26.643 --> 00:36:29.604
"I didn't know what I wanted
until I met you."

608
00:36:29.688 --> 00:36:33.692
"I didn't know what I wanted
until I met you."

609
00:36:34.025 --> 00:36:35.860
"Until" is a conjunction…

610
00:36:39.114 --> 00:36:40.490
When did you fold so many?

611
00:36:53.253 --> 00:36:54.253
Hey!

612
00:37:00.009 --> 00:37:02.429
Was I walking too fast? Sorry.

613
00:37:04.556 --> 00:37:05.557
It's okay.

614
00:37:05.640 --> 00:37:06.725
Rock, paper, scissors!

615
00:37:08.393 --> 00:37:10.103
Rock, paper, scissors!

616
00:37:14.649 --> 00:37:16.609
You owe me three notebooks next week.

617
00:37:17.235 --> 00:37:18.069
Wait, sir.

618
00:37:18.153 --> 00:37:19.154
Please.

619
00:37:20.238 --> 00:37:21.322
You want four?

620
00:37:25.368 --> 00:37:26.745
Han Yun-seok.

621
00:37:28.955 --> 00:37:31.249
Why aren't you turning in your lines?

622
00:37:31.833 --> 00:37:33.793
Oh, I hurt my leg, so...

623
00:37:33.877 --> 00:37:36.546
And you lost your mind too?

624
00:37:37.756 --> 00:37:39.674
Do you write with your foot?

625
00:37:41.301 --> 00:37:42.635
BAEK SUNG-RAE

626
00:37:42.719 --> 00:37:43.719
Bro.

627
00:37:44.262 --> 00:37:46.598
No reasoning with him. He's the law.

628
00:37:47.098 --> 00:37:49.225
Hey, why not?

629
00:37:49.309 --> 00:37:52.061
It could mess with my exams.
What are you gonna do then?

630
00:37:52.145 --> 00:37:53.897
It's just one day.

631
00:37:53.980 --> 00:37:57.358
Do you know how much each day matters
to the school's top student?

632
00:37:59.152 --> 00:38:00.028
Shoot.

633
00:38:00.111 --> 00:38:01.821
Hwang Sang-cheol.

634
00:38:01.905 --> 00:38:05.825
Switch with me just once.
It's really important.

635
00:38:05.909 --> 00:38:08.953
I said no! It's not happening!

636
00:38:09.954 --> 00:38:12.040
I really wasn't gonna say this,

637
00:38:12.624 --> 00:38:14.292
but do you think he'll say yes?

638
00:38:14.793 --> 00:38:16.419
You think Hyun's that desperate?

639
00:38:17.420 --> 00:38:19.255
Wake up.

640
00:38:19.339 --> 00:38:22.383
You must know
you're just not on his level.

641
00:38:24.135 --> 00:38:27.055
What's that chalk-covered nerd
rambling about?

642
00:38:27.138 --> 00:38:28.181
He must be insane!

643
00:38:28.264 --> 00:38:33.228
Someone needs to switch seats with her
to ask Hyun out in the self-study room.

644
00:38:33.728 --> 00:38:35.230
What a jerk move.

645
00:38:35.313 --> 00:38:37.607
- What's he got besides good grades?
- Ignore him.

646
00:38:40.735 --> 00:38:42.904
Hand me my bag. I'll carry it.

647
00:38:52.831 --> 00:38:55.041
I can carry it myself, you know.

648
00:38:58.211 --> 00:38:59.211
Thanks.

649
00:38:59.546 --> 00:39:00.797
Wait.

650
00:39:09.347 --> 00:39:10.347
Here.

651
00:39:16.396 --> 00:39:17.397
Se-ri.

652
00:39:19.649 --> 00:39:20.817
Are you crying?

653
00:39:24.362 --> 00:39:25.822
I mean,

654
00:39:25.905 --> 00:39:29.242
who does Sang-cheol think he is?

655
00:39:30.910 --> 00:39:31.953
Hey…

656
00:39:37.542 --> 00:39:38.542
Look…

657
00:39:43.798 --> 00:39:44.966
You forgot this.

658
00:39:46.050 --> 00:39:48.011
I don't care. Go inside.

659
00:39:50.054 --> 00:39:53.057
JUNE MOCK EXAM FOR 1999 CSAT

660
00:40:10.783 --> 00:40:11.783
Han Yun-seok.

661
00:40:13.536 --> 00:40:15.121
Are you taking the mock exam?

662
00:40:15.622 --> 00:40:16.622
Yes.

663
00:40:17.040 --> 00:40:18.374
All right.

664
00:40:31.763 --> 00:40:32.847
Finished?

665
00:40:33.598 --> 00:40:34.598
Yes.

666
00:41:02.835 --> 00:41:04.921
I thought you said you don't read comics.

667
00:41:06.631 --> 00:41:08.049
You told me to.

668
00:41:26.693 --> 00:41:27.693
What are you doing?

669
00:41:27.735 --> 00:41:28.778
What do you think?

670
00:41:29.278 --> 00:41:31.489
I'm praying with all my heart and soul.

671
00:41:32.323 --> 00:41:33.700
But it's already submitted.

672
00:41:35.368 --> 00:41:36.828
Be quiet.

673
00:41:36.911 --> 00:41:38.621
I'm being serious right now.

674
00:41:51.300 --> 00:41:52.927
Honestly,

675
00:41:53.011 --> 00:41:55.596
I don't know what I'll do with my life.

676
00:41:55.680 --> 00:41:58.975
There's nothing I'm good at
or really like.

677
00:41:59.726 --> 00:42:00.727
That's not true.

678
00:42:02.979 --> 00:42:04.689
There's something you're good at.

679
00:42:05.690 --> 00:42:06.690
What?

680
00:42:07.233 --> 00:42:08.233
Swimming.

681
00:42:09.694 --> 00:42:10.778
Well, I guess so.

682
00:42:11.279 --> 00:42:12.905
That's how I met Hyun too.

683
00:42:15.116 --> 00:42:16.284
Seriously,

684
00:42:16.367 --> 00:42:20.621
the second I get my hair straightened,
I swear I'm gonna tell Hyun how I feel.

685
00:42:22.081 --> 00:42:24.208
Is straight hair necessary?

686
00:42:24.292 --> 00:42:26.002
Of course.

687
00:42:26.085 --> 00:42:28.254
Who on earth would like this hair?

688
00:42:43.478 --> 00:42:44.478
Hey.

689
00:42:45.688 --> 00:42:47.023
What's this?

690
00:42:47.106 --> 00:42:49.525
You filled up the whole thing?

691
00:42:52.862 --> 00:42:56.032
I don't know what to say.

692
00:42:56.115 --> 00:43:00.119
I don't get why
this is so important, but sure.

693
00:43:00.203 --> 00:43:03.664
Of course it's important.
It means everything.

694
00:43:03.748 --> 00:43:05.958
But these are useless in the end.

695
00:43:07.460 --> 00:43:08.544
Han Yun-seok,

696
00:43:09.087 --> 00:43:10.671
this is your problem.

697
00:43:10.755 --> 00:43:12.965
Does it have to be useful
to mean something?

698
00:43:13.549 --> 00:43:19.097
There's a bit of everyone's heart in here.
Me, you, and the guys.

699
00:43:19.764 --> 00:43:25.603
Even if Hyun rejects me,
the times we shared will stay in here.

700
00:43:26.270 --> 00:43:28.981
But, of course,
Hyun wouldn't do that to me.

701
00:43:33.945 --> 00:43:37.782
All right. I shall also give you a gift.

702
00:43:40.243 --> 00:43:42.912
Pretty, isn't it?
You can use it to write your lines.

703
00:43:43.996 --> 00:43:46.082
But our teacher's just ridiculous.

704
00:43:46.165 --> 00:43:48.209
Why is he making you write lines too?

705
00:43:49.544 --> 00:43:52.964
Yeah. I've done lots of weird stuff
since I moved here.

706
00:43:58.928 --> 00:44:00.054
Yun-seok.

707
00:44:00.763 --> 00:44:02.223
You…

708
00:44:02.974 --> 00:44:05.518
You got your cast off!

709
00:44:05.601 --> 00:44:08.312
- Yeah.
- Congratulations, Yun-seok!

710
00:44:09.063 --> 00:44:10.439
I mean, <i>oppa</i>.

711
00:44:11.065 --> 00:44:11.899
Hello, Se-ri.

712
00:44:11.983 --> 00:44:13.693
Good morning.

713
00:44:13.776 --> 00:44:15.778
Thanks for all your hard work.

714
00:44:15.862 --> 00:44:18.114
Do you want to come by and get your perm?

715
00:44:18.197 --> 00:44:20.116
I'll do it for free.

716
00:44:20.199 --> 00:44:21.199
What?

717
00:44:21.576 --> 00:44:22.618
Really?

718
00:44:22.702 --> 00:44:24.829
You're really going to do it for free?

719
00:44:27.498 --> 00:44:28.916
Thank you so much!

720
00:44:29.000 --> 00:44:31.002
- Shall we do it today?
- Oh, well…

721
00:44:31.085 --> 00:44:34.380
Not today. I'll come by when I'm prepared.

722
00:44:35.298 --> 00:44:36.298
"Prepared"?

723
00:44:37.175 --> 00:44:38.509
Oh, it's nothing.

724
00:44:45.766 --> 00:44:47.685
Hey, what's going on?

725
00:44:48.186 --> 00:44:50.146
Se-ri, look.

726
00:44:50.646 --> 00:44:51.856
What is it?

727
00:44:52.940 --> 00:44:53.774
What?

728
00:44:53.858 --> 00:44:55.318
"Han Yun-seok"?

729
00:44:55.985 --> 00:44:56.985
Hey!

730
00:44:57.403 --> 00:44:58.654
Yun-seok.

731
00:44:58.738 --> 00:45:00.907
What's that all about?

732
00:45:01.782 --> 00:45:03.451
You needed a spot in the study room.

733
00:45:03.534 --> 00:45:04.534
What?

734
00:45:06.329 --> 00:45:08.039
Oh my God!

735
00:45:09.040 --> 00:45:10.333
You're freaking awesome!

736
00:45:10.416 --> 00:45:13.920
You're seriously the best, for real!

737
00:45:16.172 --> 00:45:18.299
What? Aren't you guys glad?

738
00:45:18.382 --> 00:45:19.382
What's wrong?

739
00:45:19.800 --> 00:45:21.385
Well, it's not that.

740
00:45:21.469 --> 00:45:24.472
It looks like Hyun got bumped out.

741
00:45:26.641 --> 00:45:28.226
I can't find his name anywhere.

742
00:45:35.066 --> 00:45:37.818
100TH PLACE, SON HAE-GYO

743
00:45:46.953 --> 00:45:49.247
He was just trying to help you.

744
00:46:05.137 --> 00:46:06.973
- Bok-hee.
- Hi.

745
00:46:07.056 --> 00:46:08.891
- You busy?
- Not at all.

746
00:46:08.975 --> 00:46:10.101
Have some of this.

747
00:46:10.184 --> 00:46:13.479
You shouldn't have. Thanks for this.

748
00:46:13.562 --> 00:46:15.940
Did you hear about Jang-mi
from down the street?

749
00:46:16.023 --> 00:46:16.857
Rose Hair?

750
00:46:16.941 --> 00:46:19.652
Everyone's making a fuss
about her son topping the exam.

751
00:46:19.735 --> 00:46:23.531
Yeah, but I also heard
he's not taking the CSAT.

752
00:46:24.907 --> 00:46:26.826
Life's unfair, isn't it?

753
00:46:26.909 --> 00:46:27.909
Exactly.

754
00:46:28.411 --> 00:46:32.623
They say her husband's a professor
at Seongbuk University Hospital in Seoul,

755
00:46:32.707 --> 00:46:34.917
and his family is a big deal.

756
00:46:35.001 --> 00:46:36.419
- Is that so?
- Yeah.

757
00:46:36.502 --> 00:46:38.879
Then what are the two of them
doing way out here?

758
00:46:38.963 --> 00:46:41.424
He was pathologically jealous of his wife,

759
00:46:41.507 --> 00:46:45.136
and he bullied his kid,
never happy with anything he did.

760
00:46:45.219 --> 00:46:46.762
But he's such a good kid.

761
00:46:46.846 --> 00:46:47.846
I know.

762
00:46:48.264 --> 00:46:51.475
Hurt deep down,
he couldn't settle at his old school,

763
00:46:51.559 --> 00:46:55.313
and the stress has him
sitting out this year's CSAT.

764
00:46:55.396 --> 00:46:57.523
Oh dear.

765
00:46:58.232 --> 00:47:00.359
Apparently, Jang-mi's sister
lives in America,

766
00:47:00.443 --> 00:47:02.194
and she wants her to come.

767
00:47:12.747 --> 00:47:13.914
Yun-seok?

768
00:47:14.915 --> 00:47:15.915
Se-ri, you're here.

769
00:47:16.917 --> 00:47:17.918
Dad?

770
00:47:18.544 --> 00:47:19.544
What?

771
00:47:21.047 --> 00:47:22.256
Yun-seok.

772
00:47:22.840 --> 00:47:24.884
What are you doing there?

773
00:47:24.967 --> 00:47:27.595
Oh, I made him stay for some <i>ramyeon</i>.

774
00:47:28.471 --> 00:47:29.471
<i>Ramyeon</i>?

775
00:47:34.185 --> 00:47:35.519
Let's see.

776
00:47:38.314 --> 00:47:39.314
So,

777
00:47:39.774 --> 00:47:40.816
about earlier…

778
00:47:41.484 --> 00:47:43.194
Sorry for storming off like that.

779
00:47:43.694 --> 00:47:44.694
It's okay.

780
00:47:45.738 --> 00:47:49.116
By the way,
I guess you're smarter than you look.

781
00:47:49.909 --> 00:47:51.369
Smarter than I look?

782
00:47:52.411 --> 00:47:54.205
Yun-seok, do you like taking pictures?

783
00:47:54.789 --> 00:47:56.415
- Pardon me?
- Here.

784
00:47:56.499 --> 00:47:57.875
These are disposable cameras.

785
00:47:57.958 --> 00:47:59.835
You can come and take as many as you need.

786
00:47:59.919 --> 00:48:01.754
There's a ton back there.

787
00:48:01.837 --> 00:48:04.298
My dad runs a photo studio.

788
00:48:05.216 --> 00:48:07.009
Se-ri, did you guess well on the test?

789
00:48:07.093 --> 00:48:11.138
Dad, don't say that.
I'm already feeling down about the exam.

790
00:48:11.764 --> 00:48:14.266
What for? You never do well on exams.

791
00:48:14.350 --> 00:48:17.853
Dad, stop.
Don't you have any expectations of me?

792
00:48:17.937 --> 00:48:19.772
Of course I do.

793
00:48:20.272 --> 00:48:21.607
Just not about your grades.

794
00:48:21.690 --> 00:48:25.653
That's the same as nothing.
But you expect a lot from Hye-ri.

795
00:48:25.736 --> 00:48:29.073
Tell me, has Hye-ri ever gotten you
a glass of water?

796
00:48:29.156 --> 00:48:30.241
- Never.
- Exactly.

797
00:48:30.324 --> 00:48:32.118
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

798
00:48:32.201 --> 00:48:33.744
That's why you're the best!

799
00:48:33.828 --> 00:48:35.663
- Right?
- Right.

800
00:48:43.879 --> 00:48:47.258
Stop pulling your hair down.
You'll have no hair left to straighten.

801
00:48:47.758 --> 00:48:50.678
Just let me have this.
Hyun's gonna be there too.

802
00:48:50.761 --> 00:48:52.972
Hey, so how will you ask Hyun out?

803
00:48:54.515 --> 00:48:56.725
That's the thing. What do I do?

804
00:48:59.186 --> 00:49:01.522
Give her a break.
You're stressing her out.

805
00:49:02.064 --> 00:49:03.441
Well, I didn't mean to.

806
00:49:03.524 --> 00:49:05.734
It's a shame
after everything we've prepared.

807
00:49:05.818 --> 00:49:06.902
Don't you agree?

808
00:49:08.654 --> 00:49:09.947
School trip.

809
00:49:10.030 --> 00:49:11.574
What did you say?

810
00:49:12.867 --> 00:49:14.493
I can do it on our school trip.

811
00:49:14.994 --> 00:49:18.289
I like it. It will have a campfire
and the perfect vibe.

812
00:49:18.372 --> 00:49:20.374
And we'll be out of our uniforms.

813
00:49:32.803 --> 00:49:34.096
Coming through, guys.

814
00:49:34.805 --> 00:49:36.974
Why are you coming this way?
Not going to PE?

815
00:49:37.057 --> 00:49:39.185
I gotta leave this with the teacher first.

816
00:49:39.268 --> 00:49:40.478
What is it?

817
00:49:45.733 --> 00:49:47.276
- What's this?
- What's this?

818
00:49:47.776 --> 00:49:50.362
Oh my. It's so pretty.

819
00:49:51.405 --> 00:49:52.490
Hey!

820
00:49:52.573 --> 00:49:54.074
No touching.

821
00:49:54.575 --> 00:49:57.578
My aunt sent it to me from America,
and it's expensive.

822
00:49:57.661 --> 00:50:01.332
If you're that worried,
just stay here and look after it yourself.

823
00:50:01.415 --> 00:50:03.792
No, we're playing buddy ball today.

824
00:50:04.376 --> 00:50:06.629
I love playing buddy ball.

825
00:50:12.092 --> 00:50:14.845
Stop dawdling, and, everyone, partner up.

826
00:50:14.929 --> 00:50:17.556
If the person wearing the vest
gets hit, both are out.

827
00:50:18.057 --> 00:50:19.266
Want to team up with me?

828
00:50:19.350 --> 00:50:21.435
How dare you, Flintstone.

829
00:50:21.519 --> 00:50:24.438
Sure. Go get a vest. I'll be the thrower.

830
00:50:27.858 --> 00:50:28.858
What?

831
00:50:30.110 --> 00:50:31.111
Be my buddy?

832
00:50:33.405 --> 00:50:34.698
Okay, sure.

833
00:50:34.782 --> 00:50:37.743
Who's attacking first?
I need one from each side.

834
00:50:39.286 --> 00:50:40.286
All right.

835
00:50:41.747 --> 00:50:42.747
You guys?

836
00:50:45.751 --> 00:50:46.752
You.

837
00:50:46.835 --> 00:50:47.835
Hey.

838
00:50:49.755 --> 00:50:50.839
- Me?
- Yeah.

839
00:50:58.847 --> 00:51:00.391
Here we go.

840
00:51:02.226 --> 00:51:03.852
What?

841
00:51:05.688 --> 00:51:06.897
In front of you.

842
00:51:15.990 --> 00:51:17.366
Guard the vests!

843
00:51:26.000 --> 00:51:27.001
Catch!

844
00:51:35.426 --> 00:51:36.468
Are you insane?

845
00:51:36.552 --> 00:51:39.597
Wait, I wasn't really trying to dodge it.

846
00:51:46.186 --> 00:51:49.607
Seriously?
Why is she glued to him like that?

847
00:52:01.452 --> 00:52:02.536
Nice!

848
00:52:04.455 --> 00:52:05.873
Hey! Over there!

849
00:52:08.250 --> 00:52:10.502
- Here!
- Sol-ji, shield me!

850
00:52:16.759 --> 00:52:19.136
Go, Class 7!

851
00:52:19.219 --> 00:52:21.847
Class 7!

852
00:52:21.930 --> 00:52:24.308
- Get Se-ri!
- Watch your arm.

853
00:52:28.270 --> 00:52:29.772
- Behind!
- Nice!

854
00:52:29.855 --> 00:52:30.856
Nice!

855
00:52:30.939 --> 00:52:33.067
Sung-rae,
you did that on purpose, didn't you?

856
00:52:33.692 --> 00:52:34.943
Over here!

857
00:53:41.093 --> 00:53:43.220
Oh-my-Seri, you okay?

858
00:53:43.303 --> 00:53:45.264
- She's fine!
- What were you thinking?

859
00:53:45.347 --> 00:53:47.099
- Head inside, all of you.
- Shit!

860
00:53:47.182 --> 00:53:48.726
Everyone inside.

861
00:53:53.522 --> 00:53:54.857
Crap.

862
00:53:56.734 --> 00:54:00.362
Oh man.

863
00:54:00.446 --> 00:54:02.156
Come on!

864
00:54:04.700 --> 00:54:07.536
Seriously, why did I do that?

865
00:54:11.540 --> 00:54:14.376
Yun-seok, this is Se-ri.

866
00:54:15.002 --> 00:54:17.337
What are you up to? Are you well?

867
00:54:19.757 --> 00:54:21.633
Man…

868
00:54:31.560 --> 00:54:34.772
Yun-seok, this is Se-ri.

869
00:54:35.397 --> 00:54:37.733
I'm sorry about earlier.

870
00:54:38.400 --> 00:54:43.864
You know, it wasn't on purpose.
I don't know why I did that.

871
00:54:44.490 --> 00:54:47.743
But I felt safe behind you.

872
00:54:50.454 --> 00:54:53.415
Wait, what? What am I saying?

873
00:54:54.958 --> 00:54:56.710
I can't with this.

874
00:55:04.218 --> 00:55:05.218
Who's this?

875
00:55:11.433 --> 00:55:14.353
<i>You have one message.</i>

876
00:55:15.229 --> 00:55:16.229
<i>Se-ri.</i>

877
00:55:16.730 --> 00:55:18.398
<i>This is Hyun from Class 4.</i>

878
00:55:20.150 --> 00:55:21.693
<i>Today was fun.</i>

879
00:55:23.487 --> 00:55:25.113
<i>But that must've hurt.</i>

880
00:55:26.198 --> 00:55:27.616
<i>You saved me out there.</i>

881
00:55:28.116 --> 00:55:29.116
<i>Thanks.</i>

882
00:55:30.035 --> 00:55:31.036
<i>I'll see you around.</i>

883
00:55:42.548 --> 00:55:45.509
<i>You have one message.</i>

884
00:55:47.386 --> 00:55:49.054
<i>Hey, it's Yun-seok.</i>

885
00:55:49.638 --> 00:55:50.931
<i>How's your face?</i>

886
00:55:51.890 --> 00:55:54.685
<i>I feel bad just leaving you like that.</i>

887
00:55:55.352 --> 00:55:58.063
<i>I'm not mad at you, so don't worry.</i>

888
00:55:59.898 --> 00:56:02.860
<i>Don't go rubbing eggs on that bruise.</i>

889
00:56:02.943 --> 00:56:04.987
<i>You could get salmonella.</i>

890
00:56:05.946 --> 00:56:08.949
<i>Get some ointment instead.
It'll heal faster that way.</i>

891
00:56:10.117 --> 00:56:12.411
<i>All right. See you tomorrow.</i>

892
00:56:13.412 --> 00:56:14.412
<i>Bye.</i>

893
00:57:10.677 --> 00:57:11.998
YOUTH RETREAT CENTER FACILITY MAP

894
00:57:12.054 --> 00:57:13.214
- We'll take this path.
- Right.

895
00:57:13.263 --> 00:57:14.806
The problem is getting the power.

896
00:57:14.890 --> 00:57:16.058
Then, Ha-young,

897
00:57:16.141 --> 00:57:18.310
you guys set up this area.

898
00:57:18.393 --> 00:57:20.062
The main thing is getting power.

899
00:57:20.145 --> 00:57:22.397
- I'll get it from right here.
- Hey!

900
00:57:22.981 --> 00:57:24.358
- Come on.
- Don't ruin it.

901
00:57:24.441 --> 00:57:25.525
Guys.

902
00:57:31.615 --> 00:57:32.491
- Dang, girl.
- Yikes.

903
00:57:32.574 --> 00:57:34.159
- How'd you even…
- It's fine.

904
00:57:34.660 --> 00:57:35.660
I'm all right.

905
00:57:35.702 --> 00:57:36.912
Anyway, where were we?

906
00:57:36.995 --> 00:57:37.829
Here.

907
00:57:37.913 --> 00:57:39.373
- Electricity.
- That's right.

908
00:57:39.456 --> 00:57:41.124
Where can we get it from?

909
00:57:41.208 --> 00:57:42.042
Thanks.

910
00:57:42.125 --> 00:57:43.710
- From here?
- Well…

911
00:57:43.794 --> 00:57:44.962
I'll take care of it.

912
00:57:45.462 --> 00:57:47.923
Sung-rae, you know,
you're a real pro at this.

913
00:57:48.423 --> 00:57:50.634
If this works,
Hyun's gonna be so into you.

914
00:57:50.717 --> 00:57:53.261
You picked out baby names?
Better start thinking now.

915
00:57:53.345 --> 00:57:54.262
Hey.

916
00:57:54.346 --> 00:57:55.764
I'll catch you guys later.

917
00:57:57.182 --> 00:57:58.016
You're leaving?

918
00:57:58.100 --> 00:57:59.434
- Bro.
- We've just started.

919
00:57:59.518 --> 00:58:01.687
- We have a job for you too.
- Okay.

920
00:58:03.021 --> 00:58:05.273
All right, then, you can't complain later!

921
00:58:08.819 --> 00:58:10.445
That's Park Chan-ho!

922
00:58:13.573 --> 00:58:14.774
MOBILE GRADUATION PHOTO STUDIO

923
00:58:14.825 --> 00:58:16.076
Three, two, one.

924
00:58:17.327 --> 00:58:18.161
Great.

925
00:58:18.245 --> 00:58:20.414
- Hey, look at you.
- That's a villain's beard.

926
00:58:20.497 --> 00:58:22.958
- So pointy.
- What's that on your chin?

927
00:58:23.041 --> 00:58:24.543
- Ahem!
- Is that seaweed?

928
00:58:26.003 --> 00:58:28.922
My goodness,
look what her dad made her wear.

929
00:58:30.132 --> 00:58:32.592
Golfer Pak Se-ri and her caddie!

930
00:58:35.095 --> 00:58:36.763
Look, like this.

931
00:58:36.847 --> 00:58:38.181
Fists in the air.

932
00:58:38.265 --> 00:58:39.266
Good.

933
00:58:39.766 --> 00:58:40.851
Take your socks off.

934
00:58:41.351 --> 00:58:42.351
Take them off.

935
00:58:42.394 --> 00:58:43.603
Oh, come on.

936
00:58:43.687 --> 00:58:45.313
Dad, is this really necessary?

937
00:58:46.940 --> 00:58:48.525
Seriously…

938
00:58:50.360 --> 00:58:52.070
Give me a break.

939
00:58:53.989 --> 00:58:56.408
Why is Dad making me do this?

940
00:58:57.784 --> 00:58:58.784
Ugh.

941
00:58:59.369 --> 00:59:01.246
God, I hate my hair.

942
00:59:01.747 --> 00:59:03.206
Well, I like it.

943
00:59:05.917 --> 00:59:06.917
Ready?

944
00:59:08.837 --> 00:59:12.382
All right, here we go.
Let's see that pose.

945
00:59:14.259 --> 00:59:15.302
Mr. Caddie.

946
00:59:15.385 --> 00:59:17.679
- You gotta celebrate with her.
- Bigger smile!

947
00:59:17.763 --> 00:59:19.973
- Okay.
- All right, look happy!

948
00:59:20.057 --> 00:59:21.475
What's wrong with your face?

949
00:59:21.558 --> 00:59:23.060
You're excited!

950
00:59:23.143 --> 00:59:24.186
Good!

951
00:59:32.027 --> 00:59:33.070
Hello.

952
00:59:33.153 --> 00:59:34.696
Hi, Se-ri.

953
00:59:35.363 --> 00:59:37.032
- It's hot.
- Oops. I'm sorry.

954
00:59:37.115 --> 00:59:39.034
Are you okay? My goodness.

955
00:59:39.117 --> 00:59:40.243
Se-ri.

956
00:59:40.327 --> 00:59:42.579
I'm just so busy at the moment.

957
00:59:42.662 --> 00:59:44.831
Can you go sit in the shampoo chair
for now?

958
00:59:44.915 --> 00:59:46.333
Okay.

959
00:59:48.251 --> 00:59:50.295
Oops. I didn't see that.

960
00:59:50.378 --> 00:59:52.089
That must have hurt.

961
00:59:52.172 --> 00:59:53.172
All right.

962
00:59:55.884 --> 00:59:57.094
Yun-seok!

963
00:59:57.177 --> 00:59:59.096
Can you shampoo Se-ri for me?

964
00:59:59.763 --> 01:00:00.597
What?

965
01:00:00.680 --> 01:00:02.599
You want him to do it?

966
01:00:03.225 --> 01:00:04.810
He's pretty good at it.

967
01:00:07.020 --> 01:00:09.564
I'm really sorry.

968
01:00:20.450 --> 01:00:21.450
Okay.

969
01:00:23.120 --> 01:00:24.121
Here I go.

970
01:00:34.798 --> 01:00:35.882
Sorry.

971
01:00:35.966 --> 01:00:36.966
You okay?

972
01:00:46.768 --> 01:00:47.978
Here I go again.

973
01:00:48.603 --> 01:00:49.603
Okay.

974
01:01:03.410 --> 01:01:05.036
All done.

975
01:01:07.330 --> 01:01:08.540
Have a good day.

976
01:01:08.623 --> 01:01:11.793
You must be so happy with it.
It turned out perfectly.

977
01:01:11.877 --> 01:01:14.004
- Do you mean it?
- Of course.

978
01:01:14.087 --> 01:01:17.132
I guess I'll take this out for a spin.
Oh yeah.

979
01:01:17.215 --> 01:01:19.509
- I feel good.
- Come again. No washing today!

980
01:01:19.593 --> 01:01:20.594
All right.

981
01:01:21.344 --> 01:01:22.344
Okay.

982
01:01:24.347 --> 01:01:28.018
Did he get a Seoul magic straight too?

983
01:01:28.101 --> 01:01:29.311
Sure, of course.

984
01:01:31.688 --> 01:01:32.772
I see.

985
01:01:32.856 --> 01:01:34.691
Wait, what's going on here?

986
01:01:35.192 --> 01:01:36.193
This is odd.

987
01:01:36.818 --> 01:01:37.818
Huh?

988
01:01:38.820 --> 01:01:39.820
Yun-seok.

989
01:01:40.155 --> 01:01:42.699
Did you use conditioner on her?

990
01:01:43.408 --> 01:01:45.160
Oh, did I?

991
01:01:45.243 --> 01:01:47.913
You weren't supposed to do that!

992
01:01:47.996 --> 01:01:49.581
The perm won't take now.

993
01:01:50.165 --> 01:01:51.165
Really?

994
01:01:51.208 --> 01:01:54.002
Don't act clueless.
You know better than I do.

995
01:01:54.085 --> 01:01:58.173
This isn't like you at all.
What were you thinking?

996
01:01:58.256 --> 01:02:00.217
Mom, I'll be back in a bit.

997
01:02:01.218 --> 01:02:02.928
Wait, where are you going?

998
01:02:03.428 --> 01:02:04.638
What's gotten into him?

999
01:02:06.348 --> 01:02:09.768
Se-ri, sorry about that.
I'll wash your hair again.

1000
01:02:09.851 --> 01:02:11.144
Hurry now.

1001
01:02:13.396 --> 01:02:14.396
Come on, hurry.

1002
01:02:19.694 --> 01:02:20.820
Quiet!

1003
01:02:23.949 --> 01:02:26.368
Anyone heard from Se-ri?

1004
01:02:27.452 --> 01:02:29.371
There, she's coming!

1005
01:03:03.780 --> 01:03:04.948
- So pretty!
- It's amazing!

1006
01:03:05.031 --> 01:03:06.616
Hey, the curls are completely gone!

1007
01:03:07.117 --> 01:03:09.327
It's, like, crazy smooth.

1008
01:03:15.500 --> 01:03:17.544
Looks great. It's worth the money.

1009
01:03:20.880 --> 01:03:23.425
<i>You're just too idealistic</i>

1010
01:03:23.508 --> 01:03:28.471
<i>Your gaze alone
Won't get a girl to make a move</i>

1011
01:03:28.555 --> 01:03:31.891
<i>Girls like that don't exist
And I'm no different</i>

1012
01:03:31.975 --> 01:03:35.145
<i>Just like this</i>

1013
01:03:51.328 --> 01:03:52.620
Hello!

1014
01:03:52.704 --> 01:03:53.621
Nice to see you.

1015
01:03:53.705 --> 01:03:55.373
- Mr. Park, hello.
- Hi!

1016
01:03:57.542 --> 01:03:59.336
Look over here. That's it!

1017
01:04:15.352 --> 01:04:17.854
- That's enough.
- Wait, just one more.

1018
01:04:18.438 --> 01:04:20.315
Take one with Won-yeong.

1019
01:04:23.360 --> 01:04:25.153
Three, two, one.

1020
01:04:25.653 --> 01:04:27.739
Okay! Three, two, one!

1021
01:04:43.046 --> 01:04:44.464
"Letter to my parents."

1022
01:04:46.049 --> 01:04:48.885
"Mother, Father, it's me, Sang-cheol."

1023
01:04:50.053 --> 01:04:53.056
"I know things have been tough."

1024
01:04:54.474 --> 01:04:57.727
"Not realizing how hard
last year's economy hit us,

1025
01:04:58.645 --> 01:05:01.773
I just kept whining
and made it harder on you."

1026
01:05:02.899 --> 01:05:04.234
"Mother, Father."

1027
01:05:04.734 --> 01:05:08.655
"You always say sorry to me."

1028
01:05:10.782 --> 01:05:12.909
"But you've done nothing wrong."

1029
01:05:29.426 --> 01:05:31.177
- He's here.
- Yeah.

1030
01:05:37.642 --> 01:05:38.642
Hey!

1031
01:05:39.060 --> 01:05:41.062
It's beautiful.

1032
01:05:42.272 --> 01:05:44.315
Good work. It's lovely.

1033
01:05:44.899 --> 01:05:45.899
<i>Oppa</i>.

1034
01:05:46.317 --> 01:05:47.317
The blanket.

1035
01:05:50.905 --> 01:05:52.240
Right. Yes.

1036
01:05:58.872 --> 01:05:59.747
Se-ri.

1037
01:05:59.831 --> 01:06:00.999
Are you ready?

1038
01:06:01.791 --> 01:06:02.876
Stay focused.

1039
01:06:02.959 --> 01:06:04.544
You can do this. You look amazing.

1040
01:06:04.627 --> 01:06:06.129
- You've got this.
- So pretty.

1041
01:06:06.212 --> 01:06:07.380
- You hear me?
- Give it.

1042
01:06:09.007 --> 01:06:11.176
"I will repay every last bit."

1043
01:06:12.469 --> 01:06:13.511
"Thank you,

1044
01:06:14.179 --> 01:06:15.722
and I'm sorry."

1045
01:06:15.805 --> 01:06:16.805
You startled me.

1046
01:06:16.848 --> 01:06:18.558
- "I love you."
- Follow me.

1047
01:06:18.641 --> 01:06:19.641
Why?

1048
01:06:20.059 --> 01:06:23.062
"Even in another life,
I'd choose to be your son."

1049
01:06:28.193 --> 01:06:30.361
- Quickly.
- What?

1050
01:06:33.114 --> 01:06:34.365
Hello, everyone.

1051
01:06:34.866 --> 01:06:39.204
I'm Garam High's official photographer,
Park Hong-il.

1052
01:06:44.584 --> 01:06:45.584
Go that way.

1053
01:06:47.086 --> 01:06:48.296
- That way?
- Yeah.

1054
01:07:17.867 --> 01:07:18.867
I'm back.

1055
01:07:18.910 --> 01:07:20.578
- Come.
- Scoot over.

1056
01:07:21.996 --> 01:07:22.996
Sit down.

1057
01:07:30.922 --> 01:07:33.841
I wonder who put all these lights up.

1058
01:07:38.054 --> 01:07:39.055
It's pretty.

1059
01:07:40.223 --> 01:07:41.223
Yeah.

1060
01:07:44.143 --> 01:07:45.436
I like your new hair.

1061
01:07:55.613 --> 01:07:56.698
The crane eggs.

1062
01:07:57.782 --> 01:07:58.866
That was you, right?

1063
01:07:59.909 --> 01:08:02.161
How did you know?

1064
01:08:02.245 --> 01:08:05.039
The jar had "Park Hong-il"
written on the bottom.

1065
01:08:05.123 --> 01:08:06.624
Isn't that your dad?

1066
01:08:07.250 --> 01:08:08.293
It was cute.

1067
01:08:08.918 --> 01:08:11.045
When you blocked that ball for me too.

1068
01:08:11.796 --> 01:08:13.381
Man, you were super athletic.

1069
01:08:13.881 --> 01:08:15.675
Right. Yeah.

1070
01:08:16.217 --> 01:08:19.637
I should've known when I saw you
swimming that well at our beach.

1071
01:08:20.597 --> 01:08:21.639
"Our beach"?

1072
01:08:23.391 --> 01:08:25.184
Only you and I know that spot.

1073
01:08:29.272 --> 01:08:30.690
What are they saying?

1074
01:08:30.773 --> 01:08:31.773
Don't know.

1075
01:08:32.483 --> 01:08:34.152
- Can you hear them?
- No.

1076
01:08:46.623 --> 01:08:47.623
So

1077
01:08:48.708 --> 01:08:50.960
Did you want to say something to me?

1078
01:08:55.298 --> 01:08:56.716
Yes, I did.

1079
01:08:57.216 --> 01:08:58.216
That's right.

1080
01:09:01.929 --> 01:09:03.973
Well, say it. You're making me nervous.

1081
01:09:08.603 --> 01:09:10.188
- What's happening?
- Huh?

1082
01:09:10.271 --> 01:09:11.314
What are they saying?

1083
01:09:11.397 --> 01:09:13.274
Shush, I can't hear them.

1084
01:09:14.901 --> 01:09:20.865
<i>Ah, with our love</i>

1085
01:09:23.618 --> 01:09:24.618
Hyun.

1086
01:09:25.119 --> 01:09:26.119
Yeah?

1087
01:09:27.538 --> 01:09:30.083
I liked you a lot.

1088
01:09:32.085 --> 01:09:34.504
Because of you, I got a straight perm

1089
01:09:35.004 --> 01:09:37.215
and made those crane eggs too.

1090
01:09:39.467 --> 01:09:40.467
But,

1091
01:09:41.719 --> 01:09:44.889
now that I'm here in front of you,

1092
01:09:45.390 --> 01:09:47.725
I can't stop thinking about someone else.

1093
01:09:47.809 --> 01:09:50.937
<i>And bring light within</i>

1094
01:09:51.562 --> 01:09:55.024
<i>Ah, with our love</i>…

1095
01:09:57.568 --> 01:09:58.403
They're leaving.

1096
01:09:58.486 --> 01:09:59.987
Let's go.

1097
01:10:00.655 --> 01:10:04.701
<i>Forever unchanging</i>

1098
01:10:05.284 --> 01:10:11.165
<i>We'll reach out to dark places</i>…

1099
01:10:11.249 --> 01:10:12.249
Did you tell him?

1100
01:10:12.709 --> 01:10:13.918
You guys dating now?

1101
01:10:14.627 --> 01:10:16.212
I dunno, stop asking.

1102
01:10:16.713 --> 01:10:17.713
Why?

1103
01:10:18.131 --> 01:10:19.215
What happened?

1104
01:10:19.716 --> 01:10:21.592
Be quiet. We'll get in trouble.

1105
01:10:21.676 --> 01:10:28.391
<i>Ah, with our love</i>

1106
01:10:28.891 --> 01:10:33.771
<i>Forever unchanging</i>

1107
01:10:35.440 --> 01:10:40.111
I always thought I had to change
for someone to like me.

1108
01:10:40.737 --> 01:10:45.199
Like I needed to be better and prettier.

1109
01:10:46.784 --> 01:10:47.784
But

1110
01:10:48.453 --> 01:10:52.290
I don't think about any of that
when I'm with him.

1111
01:10:53.583 --> 01:10:54.583
Is that right?

1112
01:11:03.843 --> 01:11:04.843
Wow.

1113
01:11:05.219 --> 01:11:07.555
I don't know who it is,
but I'm jealous of him.

1114
01:11:12.101 --> 01:11:13.603
You must like him a lot.

1115
01:11:17.064 --> 01:11:18.524
You think so?

1116
01:12:54.078 --> 01:12:57.123
Uh, I got <i>Audition Vol. 2 </i>for you.

1117
01:12:59.208 --> 01:13:00.208
Okay.

1118
01:13:05.047 --> 01:13:08.009
I've got studying to do, so you go ahead.

1119
01:13:08.092 --> 01:13:10.720
AUDITION

1120
01:13:11.220 --> 01:13:13.806
But you can't take it home.

1121
01:13:13.890 --> 01:13:16.100
I'll dive into it after the exam.

1122
01:13:28.821 --> 01:13:29.822
Darn it.

1123
01:13:30.323 --> 01:13:33.492
My hair keeps falling.
I don't know what to do with it.

1124
01:13:49.508 --> 01:13:50.509
Yun-seok.

1125
01:13:53.512 --> 01:13:56.223
Don't you have any questions for me?

1126
01:14:00.603 --> 01:14:01.603
About what?

1127
01:14:02.688 --> 01:14:04.273
About me and Hyun.

1128
01:14:05.775 --> 01:14:07.026
You're not curious?

1129
01:14:09.236 --> 01:14:10.863
How did it go?

1130
01:14:12.490 --> 01:14:13.490
Well,

1131
01:14:13.824 --> 01:14:14.951
I didn't ask him.

1132
01:14:20.915 --> 01:14:21.915
Why not?

1133
01:14:24.669 --> 01:14:25.669
Well,

1134
01:14:26.128 --> 01:14:27.338
I need to study.

1135
01:14:31.801 --> 01:14:34.720
Don't tell the others though.
They'll be disappointed.

1136
01:14:36.055 --> 01:14:37.055
All right.

1137
01:14:39.976 --> 01:14:41.852
And, Yun-seok…

1138
01:14:44.438 --> 01:14:47.358
Can you buy me a giant taffy
to wish me luck for my exam?

1139
01:14:51.779 --> 01:14:53.739
You think bigger taffy
means better scores?

1140
01:14:54.240 --> 01:14:55.741
Man, you're so…

1141
01:14:56.242 --> 01:14:58.244
All right, just read your comic book.

1142
01:14:58.744 --> 01:15:00.204
Seriously.

1143
01:15:02.039 --> 01:15:07.712
8 DAYS UNTIL THE CSAT

1144
01:15:09.380 --> 01:15:11.048
Hey.

1145
01:15:12.299 --> 01:15:14.510
Stop distracting me. I'm studying.

1146
01:15:14.593 --> 01:15:17.972
Forget studying.
It's time to practice guessing.

1147
01:15:20.474 --> 01:15:23.352
I could've studied more
if we didn't have to do lines.

1148
01:15:26.188 --> 01:15:28.482
I just want it all to be over.

1149
01:15:28.566 --> 01:15:32.486
I want to go see the ocean.
It's so pretty in winter.

1150
01:15:32.570 --> 01:15:37.158
If it snows,
it'll look like Flintstone's snow globe.

1151
01:15:38.451 --> 01:15:41.203
You live right by the ocean,
and you're not tired of it?

1152
01:15:41.829 --> 01:15:43.706
And have you ever seen snow in Busan?

1153
01:15:44.415 --> 01:15:46.751
Still, it's possible.

1154
01:15:54.467 --> 01:15:55.593
Hey.

1155
01:15:57.678 --> 01:15:59.013
Isn't that Yun-seok?

1156
01:16:00.014 --> 01:16:01.014
What?

1157
01:16:01.348 --> 01:16:03.851
That looks like Flintstone.

1158
01:16:20.868 --> 01:16:22.828
Where did you find something like that?

1159
01:16:22.912 --> 01:16:25.164
Oh, Se-ri asked for a big one.

1160
01:16:26.707 --> 01:16:27.750
Is it too big?

1161
01:16:29.043 --> 01:16:30.419
The bigger, the better.

1162
01:16:33.130 --> 01:16:36.467
Maybe I'll try the CSAT next year.

1163
01:16:39.136 --> 01:16:40.136
Really?

1164
01:16:46.352 --> 01:16:48.062
I thought you just hated the idea.

1165
01:16:50.439 --> 01:16:51.439
I don't know.

1166
01:16:51.857 --> 01:16:53.442
I think I can take it now.

1167
01:16:59.240 --> 01:17:00.240
What?

1168
01:17:05.538 --> 01:17:06.538
Here.

1169
01:17:07.706 --> 01:17:08.541
What is this?

1170
01:17:08.624 --> 01:17:10.751
You asked for a giant taffy.

1171
01:17:16.132 --> 01:17:17.132
Right.

1172
01:17:17.967 --> 01:17:18.968
Thanks.

1173
01:17:27.143 --> 01:17:28.978
Hey! Yun-seok!

1174
01:17:31.730 --> 01:17:32.730
Um…

1175
01:17:33.315 --> 01:17:34.315
Are you

1176
01:17:35.317 --> 01:17:37.236
and Flintstone close?

1177
01:17:38.487 --> 01:17:39.738
Flintstone?

1178
01:17:43.325 --> 01:17:44.325
No.

1179
01:17:44.910 --> 01:17:47.997
Then why are you two hanging out?

1180
01:17:52.626 --> 01:17:56.380
What, can't I hang out
with a school friend?

1181
01:17:56.463 --> 01:18:00.426
Friend? Since when were you two friends?

1182
01:18:02.928 --> 01:18:04.597
Se-ri, good luck tomorrow.

1183
01:18:06.932 --> 01:18:07.932
Hey, wait!

1184
01:18:08.726 --> 01:18:09.810
You've got this!

1185
01:18:10.394 --> 01:18:11.228
Hey!

1186
01:18:11.312 --> 01:18:13.272
Han Yun-seok!

1187
01:18:17.401 --> 01:18:19.236
Seriously, what the heck?

1188
01:18:26.493 --> 01:18:27.661
Se-ri.

1189
01:18:27.745 --> 01:18:29.038
- Here.
- I'm really sorry.

1190
01:18:29.872 --> 01:18:31.373
There's no way I can go today.

1191
01:18:31.457 --> 01:18:33.876
Dad, it's fine. How old do you think I am?

1192
01:18:33.959 --> 01:18:36.212
Mine is close by, so I can go alone.

1193
01:18:36.295 --> 01:18:37.755
Didn't I tell you?

1194
01:18:38.380 --> 01:18:40.966
I said don't eat that
because it might've gone bad.

1195
01:18:41.550 --> 01:18:44.595
Se-ri, should I take you there?

1196
01:18:44.678 --> 01:18:47.640
It's okay, really. Just go with Hye-ri.

1197
01:18:47.723 --> 01:18:49.725
Too bad it's not the same test site.

1198
01:18:50.351 --> 01:18:51.351
Good luck, Hye-ri.

1199
01:18:51.393 --> 01:18:52.853
- Thanks.
- Be right back.

1200
01:18:52.937 --> 01:18:54.063
All right. See you.

1201
01:18:54.146 --> 01:18:56.357
Aim for the top!

1202
01:18:56.440 --> 01:18:57.440
COLLEGE MEANS DATING

1203
01:18:57.483 --> 01:18:58.484
Nothing can stop you!

1204
01:18:58.567 --> 01:18:59.818
Good luck.

1205
01:19:00.736 --> 01:19:02.655
GOOD LUCK WITH THE EXAM
GET A PERFECT SCORE

1206
01:19:02.738 --> 01:19:04.406
1999 COLLEGE SCHOLASTIC ABILITY TEST

1207
01:19:04.823 --> 01:19:06.200
You got this!

1208
01:19:08.118 --> 01:19:09.118
You got this!

1209
01:19:24.301 --> 01:19:25.594
I'm sorry.

1210
01:19:40.985 --> 01:19:42.861
Go crush it!

1211
01:19:44.405 --> 01:19:45.405
Hey!

1212
01:19:49.743 --> 01:19:50.911
Se-ri,

1213
01:19:50.995 --> 01:19:52.371
good luck with the exam.

1214
01:19:53.706 --> 01:19:55.374
Okay, thanks.

1215
01:20:00.087 --> 01:20:01.087
Oops.

1216
01:20:10.014 --> 01:20:11.348
You've got this!

1217
01:20:19.898 --> 01:20:22.943
<i>Two times two is four.</i>

1218
01:20:23.027 --> 01:20:24.069
- <i>So…</i>
- Yes!

1219
01:20:24.153 --> 01:20:26.155
<i>…the answer is four.</i>

1220
01:20:26.238 --> 01:20:28.699
Goodness, how long will this last?

1221
01:20:28.782 --> 01:20:31.994
Gosh, that's just great for our trip.

1222
01:20:32.077 --> 01:20:33.579
Show some pity, will you?

1223
01:20:39.376 --> 01:20:40.377
Se-ri.

1224
01:20:41.920 --> 01:20:46.300
Aren't you gonna…
check the answers at all?

1225
01:20:47.676 --> 01:20:49.303
<i>Every six months, the interest…</i>

1226
01:20:51.930 --> 01:20:54.933
I think I skipped a line
in my answer sheet!

1227
01:20:55.601 --> 01:20:56.601
Hey.

1228
01:20:56.935 --> 01:21:01.607
It's all right. Who knows?
Maybe you scored higher that way.

1229
01:21:05.069 --> 01:21:06.445
You're right.

1230
01:21:15.954 --> 01:21:17.331
Everyone,

1231
01:21:18.332 --> 01:21:19.416
you've done well.

1232
01:21:21.585 --> 01:21:25.506
And for those of you who think
writing lines cost you the exam,

1233
01:21:26.799 --> 01:21:29.093
I was just helping with an excuse.

1234
01:21:29.176 --> 01:21:30.928
You would've wrecked it anyway.

1235
01:21:31.428 --> 01:21:32.428
Well,

1236
01:21:33.013 --> 01:21:34.723
you can't change the results now.

1237
01:21:35.224 --> 01:21:36.225
So from now on,

1238
01:21:36.809 --> 01:21:38.227
have all the fun you want.

1239
01:21:38.310 --> 01:21:40.354
Yes, sir!

1240
01:21:40.437 --> 01:21:44.316
If you're interested,
come to the <i>jokbal </i>alley by seven.

1241
01:21:46.735 --> 01:21:47.736
<i>Jokbal!</i>

1242
01:21:51.990 --> 01:21:54.243
How about some <i>tteokbokki</i>
to raise our spirits?

1243
01:21:54.326 --> 01:21:55.452
Sounds good.

1244
01:21:55.953 --> 01:21:58.956
I can't believe
food is on your mind even now.

1245
01:21:59.039 --> 01:22:00.082
Of course.

1246
01:22:00.165 --> 01:22:01.792
Hey, actually,

1247
01:22:01.875 --> 01:22:04.503
I gotta go do some stuff for my mom.

1248
01:22:04.586 --> 01:22:05.587
You're not eating?

1249
01:22:05.671 --> 01:22:06.547
No.

1250
01:22:06.630 --> 01:22:07.464
Okay.

1251
01:22:07.548 --> 01:22:09.007
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

1252
01:22:11.009 --> 01:22:13.929
I've got some stuff to do too.
You guys go ahead.

1253
01:22:14.012 --> 01:22:14.847
Really?

1254
01:22:14.930 --> 01:22:16.181
That's a bummer.

1255
01:22:16.265 --> 01:22:18.559
- I know.
- See you!

1256
01:22:40.831 --> 01:22:41.832
Se-ri.

1257
01:22:45.043 --> 01:22:46.211
What was that?

1258
01:23:14.615 --> 01:23:15.615
Walk a bit more?

1259
01:23:16.783 --> 01:23:18.243
Shall we?

1260
01:23:18.911 --> 01:23:20.037
Okay.

1261
01:23:23.040 --> 01:23:24.040
Let's race!

1262
01:23:24.082 --> 01:23:25.918
Hey, wait for me!

1263
01:23:30.506 --> 01:23:31.507
Whoa!

1264
01:23:34.927 --> 01:23:36.345
You're pretty fast.

1265
01:23:37.137 --> 01:23:38.137
Careful.

1266
01:23:42.726 --> 01:23:43.726
Hey.

1267
01:23:49.316 --> 01:23:52.903
Do you remember I saved you right here?

1268
01:23:52.986 --> 01:23:54.905
- Of course I do.
- Yeah?

1269
01:23:55.405 --> 01:23:58.492
Seriously, what were you thinking
when you jumped in here?

1270
01:24:00.911 --> 01:24:02.204
Honestly?

1271
01:24:05.332 --> 01:24:06.416
That day,

1272
01:24:07.793 --> 01:24:11.129
I was thinking about what would happen
if those waves took me.

1273
01:24:13.840 --> 01:24:15.467
I was having a really hard time.

1274
01:24:20.514 --> 01:24:21.890
But then, funnily enough,

1275
01:24:22.391 --> 01:24:24.351
I saw someone swimming there.

1276
01:24:27.896 --> 01:24:29.398
She was having so much fun.

1277
01:24:43.620 --> 01:24:45.038
PARK SE-RI

1278
01:24:45.122 --> 01:24:47.416
- Where did you...
- I was holding onto it.

1279
01:24:48.500 --> 01:24:50.544
To remember the person who saved me.

1280
01:24:54.464 --> 01:24:57.134
I'm so glad it was you, Se-ri.

1281
01:25:15.068 --> 01:25:16.069
Se-ri.

1282
01:25:22.868 --> 01:25:24.202
I like you.

1283
01:25:57.653 --> 01:25:59.071
We're here again.

1284
01:26:00.906 --> 01:26:01.906
Yeah.

1285
01:26:08.372 --> 01:26:09.372
Hey,

1286
01:26:10.040 --> 01:26:12.668
what are you doing on Sunday?

1287
01:26:15.671 --> 01:26:16.880
I'll be seeing you.

1288
01:26:20.050 --> 01:26:21.885
Oh, is that so?

1289
01:26:23.178 --> 01:26:24.346
Okay.

1290
01:26:24.429 --> 01:26:26.264
I'll see you then.

1291
01:27:56.646 --> 01:27:57.646
Mom.

1292
01:27:58.064 --> 01:27:59.064
Oh.

1293
01:27:59.733 --> 01:28:00.733
Hi.

1294
01:28:02.486 --> 01:28:06.656
Looks like
I need to go to Seoul on Sunday.

1295
01:28:07.908 --> 01:28:09.117
Why all of a sudden?

1296
01:28:09.201 --> 01:28:11.995
I heard there's new equipment
at the suppliers' in Seoul.

1297
01:28:12.496 --> 01:28:15.499
You know I'm nothing without my equipment.

1298
01:28:16.208 --> 01:28:17.501
Want me to come with you?

1299
01:28:18.001 --> 01:28:18.835
No.

1300
01:28:18.919 --> 01:28:21.963
People will wonder why the shop's closed.

1301
01:28:22.047 --> 01:28:24.800
You should stay and explain to them.

1302
01:28:25.300 --> 01:28:26.343
Okay.

1303
01:28:27.844 --> 01:28:28.887
Do we have everything?

1304
01:28:29.763 --> 01:28:33.016
I'm off now. Take care of Busan for me.

1305
01:28:33.517 --> 01:28:36.728
<i>Don't worry. Busan's in safe hands.</i>

1306
01:28:38.104 --> 01:28:39.189
<i>That's reassuring.</i>

1307
01:28:39.272 --> 01:28:41.066
<i>Se-ri, hurry up!</i>

1308
01:28:41.149 --> 01:28:42.776
<i>See you on Sunday.</i>

1309
01:28:42.859 --> 01:28:44.736
Okay. Enjoy your trip.

1310
01:28:44.820 --> 01:28:46.154
All right, let's go.

1311
01:28:46.238 --> 01:28:47.072
Okay.

1312
01:28:47.155 --> 01:28:48.490
- Bye.
- Bye.

1313
01:28:48.573 --> 01:28:49.991
<i>Yeah, bye!</i>

1314
01:28:52.285 --> 01:28:53.203
Aren't you coming?

1315
01:28:53.286 --> 01:28:54.538
I said okay!

1316
01:28:54.621 --> 01:28:56.206
Will you hurry up?

1317
01:28:56.289 --> 01:28:58.708
Hi, Sol-ji.
Sunday at Gwangalli Beach, right?

1318
01:28:58.792 --> 01:29:02.254
<i>I'm counting on all of you.
You guys are the best.</i>

1319
01:29:02.337 --> 01:29:03.547
<i>Thank you so much.</i>

1320
01:29:04.756 --> 01:29:05.756
You heard her.

1321
01:29:06.675 --> 01:29:09.594
This is the last project
of our school days.

1322
01:29:18.186 --> 01:29:19.437
Aren't you cold?

1323
01:29:20.522 --> 01:29:24.526
Sure, it's cold,
but we can't miss the stars.

1324
01:29:25.777 --> 01:29:28.154
My sweet Hye-ri and Se-ri,

1325
01:29:28.738 --> 01:29:30.574
I hope all your dreams come true,

1326
01:29:31.283 --> 01:29:33.159
and you have happy lives.

1327
01:29:36.246 --> 01:29:37.330
Wait.

1328
01:29:37.414 --> 01:29:38.414
What about me?

1329
01:29:39.749 --> 01:29:42.168
- Your dream's already come true.
- It has?

1330
01:29:42.919 --> 01:29:45.088
You married me.

1331
01:29:45.171 --> 01:29:46.840
You must be insane!

1332
01:29:47.757 --> 01:29:48.925
- What?
- Unbelievable.

1333
01:29:49.009 --> 01:29:52.762
You said that was your dream
when you asked me out.

1334
01:29:52.846 --> 01:29:54.472
Zip it, old man.

1335
01:29:58.518 --> 01:30:00.729
Hey! Speed it up!

1336
01:30:00.812 --> 01:30:01.813
Is this right?

1337
01:30:01.897 --> 01:30:02.897
- This?
- No.

1338
01:30:04.524 --> 01:30:06.109
- Stick it here?
- Yeah.

1339
01:30:08.236 --> 01:30:09.279
It won't stand.

1340
01:30:11.281 --> 01:30:12.824
- Ha-young.
- Yeah?

1341
01:30:12.908 --> 01:30:14.075
Look. Is this okay?

1342
01:30:14.993 --> 01:30:16.036
Yeah, looks good.

1343
01:30:21.374 --> 01:30:23.793
Hey, they're coming!

1344
01:30:23.877 --> 01:30:25.795
- What?
- Come on!

1345
01:30:26.296 --> 01:30:28.048
Run!

1346
01:30:37.349 --> 01:30:38.224
You must be cold.

1347
01:30:38.308 --> 01:30:39.308
What?

1348
01:30:39.684 --> 01:30:41.186
No, I'm okay.

1349
01:30:46.983 --> 01:30:48.151
No!

1350
01:30:49.945 --> 01:30:51.404
- Go?
- Now?

1351
01:30:56.952 --> 01:30:58.787
I knew you'd need this.

1352
01:30:59.871 --> 01:31:01.581
Oh, thanks.

1353
01:31:04.542 --> 01:31:05.961
Do you want to go inside?

1354
01:31:06.044 --> 01:31:06.920
Huh?

1355
01:31:07.003 --> 01:31:08.838
No, I'm fine.

1356
01:31:20.350 --> 01:31:23.395
Not now. Go back inside.

1357
01:31:25.021 --> 01:31:26.606
Huh? To the right?

1358
01:31:27.107 --> 01:31:27.941
- Right?
- Okay.

1359
01:31:28.024 --> 01:31:29.024
That way.

1360
01:31:31.695 --> 01:31:34.906
Wait, is that the cue? Should we hit play?

1361
01:31:38.034 --> 01:31:39.494
- Se-ri, just a moment.
- Huh?

1362
01:31:43.331 --> 01:31:46.626
Go back inside! Go inside!

1363
01:31:53.299 --> 01:31:54.926
I need to use a phone.

1364
01:32:04.102 --> 01:32:06.229
Just wait. Wait for my cue!

1365
01:32:08.231 --> 01:32:09.231
What?

1366
01:32:10.442 --> 01:32:11.442
Wait!

1367
01:32:16.114 --> 01:32:17.114
Hey.

1368
01:32:17.574 --> 01:32:18.908
Are you okay?

1369
01:32:19.909 --> 01:32:21.369
Se-ri, I'm sorry.

1370
01:32:21.953 --> 01:32:23.913
I need to go to Seoul right now.

1371
01:32:25.206 --> 01:32:26.708
My mom's in the hospital.

1372
01:32:31.129 --> 01:32:34.674
SE-RI ♡ YUN-SEOK

1373
01:32:43.391 --> 01:32:44.391
Se-ri.

1374
01:32:45.518 --> 01:32:47.854
It's fine. We can do it again.

1375
01:32:49.564 --> 01:32:51.941
I'm so sorry. You all worked so hard.

1376
01:32:54.694 --> 01:32:56.154
Don't worry. We'll do it again.

1377
01:33:05.288 --> 01:33:07.040
<i>Please leave a message.</i>

1378
01:33:09.334 --> 01:33:10.627
Yun-seok.

1379
01:33:11.795 --> 01:33:14.089
I can't seem to reach you.

1380
01:33:15.340 --> 01:33:17.926
Is your mom doing okay?

1381
01:33:19.094 --> 01:33:22.555
Leave me a voicemail
when you get the chance.

1382
01:33:23.890 --> 01:33:25.058
I'll be waiting.

1383
01:33:49.040 --> 01:33:51.543
I LIKE YOU TOO

1384
01:34:11.688 --> 01:34:13.022
Have you gotten taller?

1385
01:34:17.861 --> 01:34:20.071
It's been quite a while.

1386
01:34:20.155 --> 01:34:22.198
Is that how you greet your father?

1387
01:34:25.201 --> 01:34:26.828
She slipped on the stairs.

1388
01:34:27.996 --> 01:34:30.123
You know how clumsy she can be.

1389
01:34:31.541 --> 01:34:33.376
I heard you skipped the CSAT.

1390
01:34:37.130 --> 01:34:39.424
She never cared about your studies.

1391
01:34:40.091 --> 01:34:41.843
And she calls herself a mother.

1392
01:34:48.558 --> 01:34:49.851
So you did this to her?

1393
01:34:58.401 --> 01:35:01.279
This is why I don't trust her.

1394
01:35:02.739 --> 01:35:06.034
She said you're happier
and more cheerful down there,

1395
01:35:07.202 --> 01:35:09.037
but you've just become rude and dumb.

1396
01:35:19.881 --> 01:35:20.881
Han Yun-seok.

1397
01:35:23.218 --> 01:35:24.510
Get back home.

1398
01:35:33.645 --> 01:35:37.232
FOR RENT

1399
01:35:40.318 --> 01:35:42.654
Man, what happened to him?

1400
01:35:42.737 --> 01:35:44.697
I wish he could just call us.

1401
01:35:44.781 --> 01:35:48.201
My mom says the realtor received a call.

1402
01:35:49.118 --> 01:35:51.371
Apparently, the paperwork's all done.

1403
01:35:52.080 --> 01:35:55.208
But the call wasn't from Yun-seok's mom.

1404
01:35:55.959 --> 01:35:57.210
What does that mean?

1405
01:35:58.044 --> 01:36:01.047
<i>Her husband's a professor
at Seongbuk University Hospital.</i>

1406
01:36:01.130 --> 01:36:03.675
He bullied his kid,
never happy with anything he did.

1407
01:36:04.259 --> 01:36:05.385
I have to go.

1408
01:36:07.387 --> 01:36:08.471
Se-ri!

1409
01:36:15.853 --> 01:36:17.021
Where are you going?

1410
01:36:17.522 --> 01:36:18.523
Se-ri!

1411
01:36:20.358 --> 01:36:26.322
<i>This is Saemaeul Train No. 11,
bound for Seoul Station.</i>

1412
01:36:39.502 --> 01:36:42.797
SAEMAEUL TRAIN TICKET
BUSAN TO SEOUL

1413
01:36:48.261 --> 01:36:50.513
<i>Show your love through giving.</i>

1414
01:36:53.182 --> 01:36:56.019
SEONGBUK UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL

1415
01:37:02.942 --> 01:37:03.942
Well…

1416
01:37:04.569 --> 01:37:06.321
Excuse me.

1417
01:37:06.904 --> 01:37:09.782
Is there a patient
named Baek Jang-mi here?

1418
01:37:45.401 --> 01:37:49.614
BAEK JANG-MI

1419
01:37:55.328 --> 01:37:57.538
Auntie called.

1420
01:38:03.878 --> 01:38:05.797
She said to come to America now…

1421
01:38:08.299 --> 01:38:11.386
Because once we return home,
he'll never let us leave again.

1422
01:38:16.182 --> 01:38:18.226
We should go, right?

1423
01:38:33.282 --> 01:38:35.701
To be honest, I don't know what to do.

1424
01:38:42.417 --> 01:38:43.709
I don't want to go.

1425
01:39:03.813 --> 01:39:04.897
Mom.

1426
01:39:05.898 --> 01:39:07.733
I don't want to leave.

1427
01:39:11.946 --> 01:39:12.946
I just…

1428
01:39:16.075 --> 01:39:18.077
I just want to go back to Busan.

1429
01:39:45.980 --> 01:39:47.190
Hi.

1430
01:39:47.273 --> 01:39:48.274
It's me.

1431
01:39:49.942 --> 01:39:51.652
I can't get a hold of you.

1432
01:39:53.446 --> 01:39:56.491
I have something to tell you.

1433
01:40:04.248 --> 01:40:05.291
Yun-seok.

1434
01:40:08.920 --> 01:40:10.254
I miss you.

1435
01:40:11.589 --> 01:40:13.925
I miss you so much.

1436
01:40:49.835 --> 01:40:51.629
Hi, it's me.

1437
01:40:52.713 --> 01:40:54.549
I can't get a hold of you.

1438
01:40:55.800 --> 01:40:57.885
I have something to tell you.

1439
01:41:01.556 --> 01:41:04.976
I thought about it while you were gone.

1440
01:41:05.977 --> 01:41:10.189
I don't think I see you
as anything more than a friend.

1441
01:41:11.649 --> 01:41:12.649
And

1442
01:41:13.317 --> 01:41:17.154
if we keep spending time together,

1443
01:41:17.238 --> 01:41:20.241
it'll probably lead to misunderstandings.

1444
01:41:23.536 --> 01:41:25.246
It's better if we stop seeing each other.

1445
01:41:27.623 --> 01:41:29.750
<i>Don't call me anymore.</i>

1446
01:41:58.529 --> 01:42:02.992
GARAM HIGH SCHOOL
GRADUATION CEREMONY

1447
01:42:10.124 --> 01:42:11.124
Park Se-ri.

1448
01:42:11.959 --> 01:42:13.210
Se-ri.

1449
01:42:14.128 --> 01:42:16.922
Wow, I never thought I'd see this day.

1450
01:42:18.341 --> 01:42:20.301
- Well done.
- Thank you.

1451
01:42:23.846 --> 01:42:25.389
- Jang Yun-ho.
- Yes, sir.

1452
01:42:25.473 --> 01:42:27.975
Wow, S.E.S. You all look amazing.

1453
01:42:28.059 --> 01:42:30.102
- Right?
- Right.

1454
01:42:30.186 --> 01:42:31.646
And quit smoking.

1455
01:42:35.691 --> 01:42:37.485
- Han Seong-min.
- Yes, sir.

1456
01:42:37.568 --> 01:42:40.279
PAK SE-RI AND HER CADDIE

1457
01:43:24.949 --> 01:43:27.159
AUDITION

1458
01:43:47.179 --> 01:43:48.639
CHRONICLES OF LOVE

1459
01:44:05.239 --> 01:44:08.242
BEACH, 1998
WHERE I MET YOU

1460
01:44:13.247 --> 01:44:15.040
SE-RI, SOLBANGUL, SUNG-RAE

1461
01:44:15.124 --> 01:44:17.042
SE-RI'S FAVORITE, CORN PUFFS

1462
01:44:22.923 --> 01:44:26.135
THE WEIRDEST KIDS ON EARTH

1463
01:44:26.218 --> 01:44:29.138
CUTE. ARE YOU A BABY BIRD OR WHAT?

1464
01:44:29.221 --> 01:44:33.100
SE-RI AS PAK SE-RI
HER FACE SAYS IT ALL

1465
01:44:38.606 --> 01:44:40.316
YOU FOUND ME!

1466
01:44:40.399 --> 01:44:43.486
I LIKE EVERY VERSION OF YOU, SE-RI

1467
01:44:48.866 --> 01:44:52.453
I LIKE IT WHEN YOU LAUGH

1468
01:44:53.370 --> 01:44:56.123
I LIKE IT WHEN YOU MAKE ME LAUGH

1469
01:45:03.214 --> 01:45:05.341
I JUST LIKE YOU

1470
01:45:10.763 --> 01:45:14.517
I'll BE ROOTING FOR YOU ALWAYS

1471
01:45:19.939 --> 01:45:21.857
<i>Hi, Se-ri.</i>

1472
01:45:24.735 --> 01:45:27.613
<i>I'm writing down my feelings here</i>

1473
01:45:27.696 --> 01:45:29.365
<i>with pictures of things you like.</i>

1474
01:45:30.074 --> 01:45:33.410
<i>Your dad helped me with this,
and I hope he kept it a secret.</i>

1475
01:45:43.087 --> 01:45:45.005
<i>Like you once said,</i>

1476
01:45:45.506 --> 01:45:49.218
<i>I filled this with my heart
from all the times we shared,</i>

1477
01:45:49.718 --> 01:45:51.303
<i>and that alone makes me happy.</i>

1478
01:45:53.514 --> 01:45:54.723
<i>Se-ri,</i>

1479
01:45:55.432 --> 01:45:59.353
<i>you pulled me out of the water
and my dreams.</i>

1480
01:45:59.937 --> 01:46:01.814
<i>For that, I'm truly grateful.</i>

1481
01:46:03.899 --> 01:46:06.151
<i>Your name,
which I held tightly in my hand…</i>

1482
01:46:06.235 --> 01:46:07.736
CHRONICLES OF LOVE

1483
01:46:07.820 --> 01:46:10.447
<i>…is now engraved in my heart
and can't be erased.</i>

1484
01:46:13.033 --> 01:46:14.827
<i>I am so glad</i>

1485
01:46:16.245 --> 01:46:18.539
<i>I met you on that windy day.</i>

1486
01:46:31.802 --> 01:46:33.637
<i>I love you, Park Se-ri.</i>

1487
01:47:12.676 --> 01:47:14.011
Keep it straight!

1488
01:47:14.094 --> 01:47:15.429
Arms straight!

1489
01:47:15.512 --> 01:47:18.015
Keep your pace. Turn!

1490
01:47:30.486 --> 01:47:33.948
MARINE SPORTS DEPARTMENT
PARK SE-RI

1491
01:47:38.535 --> 01:47:39.954
- Hey.
- <i>Oh-my-Seri!</i>

1492
01:47:40.037 --> 01:47:41.872
<i>Where are you? What's taking so long?</i>

1493
01:47:42.498 --> 01:47:44.833
Man, I can't get used to your voice.

1494
01:47:44.917 --> 01:47:47.544
My class just ended. Stop bugging me.

1495
01:47:47.628 --> 01:47:49.088
<i>Fine. Just hurry up.</i>

1496
01:47:50.297 --> 01:47:51.423
Will you guys stop?

1497
01:47:51.507 --> 01:47:54.176
Hey, save that for when we're not around.

1498
01:47:54.259 --> 01:47:55.344
No.

1499
01:47:55.427 --> 01:47:57.388
- Oh my God.
- You're so cute!

1500
01:47:58.389 --> 01:48:00.099
You're just so cute.

1501
01:48:00.182 --> 01:48:01.433
You're cute too.

1502
01:48:02.685 --> 01:48:04.353
Stop. My eyeballs are melting.

1503
01:48:04.979 --> 01:48:05.813
Have a bite.

1504
01:48:05.896 --> 01:48:07.147
Can I get a medium beer?

1505
01:48:07.231 --> 01:48:09.566
Hey, don't blow the blind date tomorrow.

1506
01:48:10.734 --> 01:48:12.152
I never said I'd do it.

1507
01:48:12.236 --> 01:48:13.612
Hey.

1508
01:48:14.405 --> 01:48:15.864
You won't come?

1509
01:48:17.366 --> 01:48:19.827
But I already saved
the lucky table for you.

1510
01:48:19.910 --> 01:48:21.412
Lucky table?

1511
01:48:21.912 --> 01:48:24.456
That's where it all begins.

1512
01:48:25.040 --> 01:48:26.040
Sir.

1513
01:48:26.375 --> 01:48:29.336
I told you it's a secret.
You weren't supposed to tell!

1514
01:48:29.920 --> 01:48:30.920
You're right.

1515
01:48:31.255 --> 01:48:32.464
It's fine.

1516
01:48:33.048 --> 01:48:36.969
Confess your feelings there,
and it just works every time.

1517
01:48:37.052 --> 01:48:38.053
I did too.

1518
01:48:39.221 --> 01:48:41.390
My darling's from Seoul,

1519
01:48:42.307 --> 01:48:43.809
and we met right here.

1520
01:48:47.771 --> 01:48:48.897
Honey.

1521
01:48:49.815 --> 01:48:51.275
All right.

1522
01:48:51.358 --> 01:48:52.484
I'll be right there.

1523
01:48:55.404 --> 01:48:56.697
Please come tomorrow.

1524
01:48:56.780 --> 01:48:58.699
You definitely have to now.

1525
01:49:01.118 --> 01:49:03.078
There are couples everywhere.

1526
01:49:07.916 --> 01:49:12.171
Oh-my-Seri, you better show up tomorrow!

1527
01:49:13.005 --> 01:49:14.840
You have to, for me!

1528
01:49:29.646 --> 01:49:30.981
Please come again.

1529
01:49:36.987 --> 01:49:38.530
What are you thinking about?

1530
01:49:43.160 --> 01:49:44.203
Well,

1531
01:49:44.745 --> 01:49:47.039
years ago, on that beach,

1532
01:49:47.539 --> 01:49:51.877
I planned the love confession of my life.

1533
01:49:52.836 --> 01:49:53.921
Did it work?

1534
01:49:55.756 --> 01:49:58.634
I wouldn't be sitting here if it did.

1535
01:49:58.717 --> 01:50:01.220
You never know who you'll meet in life.

1536
01:50:01.887 --> 01:50:03.972
I never thought I'd live in Busan either.

1537
01:50:31.875 --> 01:50:38.340
SORRY, I CAN'T MAKE IT TODAY
I'M NOT FEELING WELL

1538
01:50:50.561 --> 01:50:52.896
YOU LOOK FINE TO ME

1539
01:51:02.406 --> 01:51:04.616
Hello? What is this?

1540
01:51:06.702 --> 01:51:07.828
Hello?

1541
01:51:08.620 --> 01:51:10.664
Where are you right now?

1542
01:51:10.747 --> 01:51:12.374
- Hey!
- Mr. Kim Yeong-sik?

1543
01:51:13.041 --> 01:51:14.376
- Here!
- Hello?

1544
01:51:14.459 --> 01:51:15.459
Over here!

1545
01:51:20.340 --> 01:51:21.340
Babe!

1546
01:51:35.022 --> 01:51:37.649
Seriously, are you messing with me?

1547
01:51:38.817 --> 01:51:39.985
Se-ri.

1548
01:52:15.437 --> 01:52:16.480
How have you been?

1549
01:52:25.572 --> 01:52:26.865
Yun-seok.

1550
01:52:28.825 --> 01:52:30.160
I'm sorry.

1551
01:52:33.455 --> 01:52:36.792
I lied to you back then.

1552
01:52:37.960 --> 01:52:40.837
I actually missed you so much.

1553
01:52:42.256 --> 01:52:43.298
I know.

1554
01:52:43.799 --> 01:52:44.925
You told me.

1555
01:52:47.386 --> 01:52:48.386
I did?

1556
01:52:50.264 --> 01:52:51.598
You didn't know, did you?

1557
01:52:52.349 --> 01:52:54.434
The messages get saved,
even if you hang up.

1558
01:52:55.769 --> 01:52:56.770
<i>Yun-seok.</i>

1559
01:52:58.021 --> 01:52:59.398
<i>I miss you.</i>

1560
01:52:59.481 --> 01:53:02.192
I miss you so much.

1561
01:53:14.371 --> 01:53:16.498
I didn't want to delete your voice,

1562
01:53:16.999 --> 01:53:19.001
so I've been paying my pager bill
all this time.

1563
01:53:27.926 --> 01:53:30.470
Here. I have something for you.

1564
01:53:40.689 --> 01:53:43.608
I made one every time I thought of you,
and it became this.

1565
01:53:45.986 --> 01:53:47.904
Come on…

1566
01:53:50.615 --> 01:53:51.615
Se-ri.

1567
01:53:53.618 --> 01:53:54.618
Will you…

1568
01:53:56.747 --> 01:53:57.748
Be my girlfriend?

1569
01:54:02.169 --> 01:54:03.169
Yeah.

1570
01:54:09.176 --> 01:54:11.178
Finally…

1571
01:54:29.029 --> 01:54:32.616
Oh-my-Seri's got a boyfriend!

1572
01:54:37.579 --> 01:54:40.749
<i>I thought it was over long ago,</i>

1573
01:54:40.832 --> 01:54:45.045
<i>but our final love confession
turned out to be a success.</i>

1574
01:55:02.145 --> 01:55:03.145
Hey.

1575
01:55:03.897 --> 01:55:04.897
Gimme.

1576
01:55:05.399 --> 01:55:06.399
Give me that.

1577
01:55:09.111 --> 01:55:10.278
Give it here.

1578
01:55:10.779 --> 01:55:12.614
- Give me some too.
- Okay.

1579
01:55:12.697 --> 01:55:13.698
Here.

1580
01:58:44.492 --> 01:58:49.497
Subtitle translation by: Taeyoung Kim
